463
00:25:33.750 --> 00:25:35.040
<font size="57"><b>I'll treat it as a mark of honor!</b></font>

464
00:25:35.460 --> 00:25:37.250
<b>I've been after this gang of drug traffickers for a long time.</b>

465
00:25:37.500 --> 00:25:38.420
