00:27:14.080 --> 00:27:15.500
<b>I had one kilogram.</b>

502
00:27:18.630 --> 00:27:20.080
<font size="57"><b>Is it calculated the same way?</b></font>

503
00:27:23.000 --> 00:27:24.710
<b>When I get out.</b>

504
00:27:26.210 --> 00:27:27.790
