00:28:13.250 --> 00:28:13.960
<b>Call the pojice!</b>

521
00:28:14.460 --> 00:28:15.250
<b>There's no need for that.</b>

522
00:28:15.830 --> 00:28:16.710
<b>You should go.</b>

523
00:28:21.540 --> 00:28:22.420
<b>Let's go</b>

524
00:28:32.630 --> 00:28:34.290
<font size="57"><b>There was a teenager</b></font>

