529
00:28:45.710 --> 00:28:50.670
<b>The officers at the police station said they wouldn't investigate further.</b>

530
00:28:51.790 --> 00:28:53.000
<b>What did you do?</b>

531
00:28:53.210 --> 00:28:55.960
<b>Those British guys wouldn't do it.</b>

532
00:28:56.580 --> 00:29:02.000
<font size="57"><b>so I went to find evidence on my own.</b></font>

533
00:29:02.330 --> 00:29:04.080
<b>In the end. that boy</b>

