535
00:29:06.830 --> 00:29:08.080
<b>You already know about it?</b>

536
00:29:10.420 --> 00:29:11.620
<b>You've talked about this case</b>

537
00:29:12.790 --> 00:29:14.500
<b>many times.</b>

538
00:29:14.630 --> 00:29:16.210
<b>It happened over forty years ago.</b>

539
00:29:16.210 --> 00:29:17.870
<b>You solved the case. too.</b>

540
00:29:21.500 --> 00:29:22.670
<font size="57"><b>Your boss</b></font>

541
00:29:24.500 --> 00:29:26.370
<b>even gave you this medal.</b>

542
00:29:30.540 --> 00:29:34.540
<b>I thought this case happened just five days ago.</b>

543
00:29:35.080 --> 00:29:36.250
<b>Anyway.</b>

544
00:29:36.540 --> 00:29:39.500
<b>law enforcers must stay true to their mission.</b>

545
00:29:39.500 --> 00:29:43.040
<b>Even if one day you can't walk like me.</b>

546
00:29:43.250 --> 00:29:45.500
<b>you won't have any regrets.</b>

547
00:29:46.250 --> 00:29:48.290
<b>Maybe you just need to stop and rest.</b>

548
00:29:49.290 --> 00:29:50.330
<font size="57"><b>after talking for so long!</b></font>

549
00:29:50.830 --> 00:29:52.580
<b>Do you still remember who I am?</b>

550
00:30:02.880 --> 00:30:04.080
<b>I'm hungry.</b>

551
00:30:04.580 --> 00:30:06.750
<b>Take me back to the nursing home.</b>

552
00:30:10.670 --> 00:30:11.670
<b>Okay.</b>

553
00:30:21.670 --> 00:30:23.250
<b>Why are you so slow?</b>

554
00:30:23.710 --> 00:30:24.960
<b>Back in the day.</b>

555
00:30:24.960 --> 00:30:26.330
<b>your dad.</b>

556
00:30:26.830 --> 00:30:30.790
<b>saw some thieves robbing a jewelry store. and then get on a bus.</b>

557
00:30:31.000 --> 00:30:33.210
