579
00:31:36.080 --> 00:31:37.500
<b>has always wanted a reduced sentence.</b>

580
00:31:38.670 --> 00:31:40.420
<b>So. admitting guilt was enough. right?</b>

581
00:31:40.460 --> 00:31:42.290
<b>Why do the reverse plea then?</b>

582
00:31:42.500 --> 00:31:45.210
<b>Are you gambling with ten years?</b>

583
00:31:45.500 --> 00:31:47.080
<b>What if he's being misled?</b>

584
00:31:47.460 --> 00:31:49.670
<font size="57"><b>All we're doing is giving him another chance.</b></font>

585
00:31:50.000 --> 00:31:51.750
<b>The Department of Justice is responsible for prosecution.</b>

586
00:31:52.250 --> 00:31:55.080
<b>and their main duty is to convict the accused.</b>

587
00:31:55.170 --> 00:31:57.670
<b>Mr. Fok. now you're helping the defense.</b>

588
00:31:59.330 --> 00:32:00.620
<b>What are you trying to do?</b>

589
00:32:01.460 --> 00:32:03.120
<b>You want to prove his innocence?</b>

590
00:32:03.580 --> 00:32:04.790
<b>That's not how I see it. Mr. Yeung.</b>

591
00:32:04.790 --> 00:32:06.250
<font size="57"><b>I believe that as prosecutors.</b></font>

592
00:32:06.250 --> 00:32:08.620
<b>we should convict the guilty</b>

593
00:32:09.210 --> 00:32:10.710
<b>and establish the innocence of the innocent.</b>

594
00:32:11.040 --> 00:32:14.620
<b>After Ma Ka-kit admitted his guilt. then denied it.</b>

595
00:32:15.460 --> 00:32:16.540
<b>it's clear that</b>

596
00:32:16.830 --> 00:32:18.540
<b>one of them is lying.</b>

597
00:32:18.580 --> 00:32:20.000
<b>or maybe both are lying.</b>

598
00:32:20.080 --> 00:32:22.330
<font size="57"><b>Playing along with him is a waste of manpower. resources.</b></font>

599
00:32:22.330 --> 00:32:24.710
<b>and the most precious thing: time. Mr. Fok.</b>

600
00:32:27.630 --> 00:32:29.250
<b>Okay. Mr. Bao.</b>

601
00:32:30.290 --> 00:32:33.370
<b>I want you to summon Lee Sze-man and Au Pak-man</b>

602
00:32:33.540 --> 00:32:36.250
<b>to testify in court regarding Ma Ka-kit's lack of honesty.</b>

603
00:32:36.250 --> 00:32:36.920
<b>Okay.</b>

604
00:32:37.540 --> 00:32:39.210
<b>And regarding this case.</b>

605
00:32:39.250 --> 00:32:41.420
<font size="57"><b>I want to assign you as the lead prosecutor.</b></font>

606
00:32:42.080 --> 00:32:44.250
<b>Please demonstrate to Mr. Fok</b>

607
00:32:44.460 --> 00:32:46.790
<b>how prosecutors handle cases.</b>

608
00:32:47.460 --> 00:32:48.330
<b>Excuse me.</b>

609
00:32:48.750 --> 00:32:49.580
<b>Lunch time.</b>

610
00:32:50.040 --> 00:32:50.870
<b>That's how it is.</b>

611
00:33:40.920 --> 00:33:41.750
<b>Court!</b>

612
00:33:53.290 --> 00:33:55.170
<b>Since this case involves an on-site arrest.</b>

613
00:33:55.500 --> 00:33:59.120
<font size="57"><b>the prosecution has decided to continue prosecuting the first and second defendants.</b></font>

614
00:33:59.130 --> 00:34:01.580
<b>The prosecution will first summon Inspector Lee King-wai.</b>

615
00:34:01.580 --> 00:34:03.670
<b>who was responsible for the arrest operation. to testify.</b>

616
00:34:04.130 --> 00:34:06.170
<b>When we went to arrest Ma Ka-kit that day.</b>

617
00:34:06.170 --> 00:34:07.540
<b>he attempted to escape.</b>

618
00:34:07.630 --> 00:34:11.420
<font size="57"><b>My client saw unfamiliar individuals without uniforms</b></font>

619
00:34:11.670 --> 00:34:14.460
<b>holding questionable identification.</b>

620
00:34:14.460 --> 00:34:15.830
<b>so he got scared and ran.</b>

621
00:34:16.130 --> 00:34:18.120
<b>Are false documents a reasonable excuse?</b>

622
00:34:18.130 --> 00:34:20.580
<b>Did the entire team of officers deceive him with false documents?</b>

623
00:34:20.830 --> 00:34:22.120
<b>Unbelievable!</b>

624
00:34:22.130 --> 00:34:23.080
<b>No. your Honor.</b>

625
00:34:23.080 --> 00:34:27.670
<font size="57"><b>I just want to point out that my client was terrified at that time.</b></font>

626
00:34:27.960 --> 00:34:30.040
<b>I have no other questions. Your Honor.</b>

627
00:34:30.330 --> 00:34:32.420
<b>I. Lee Sze-man. sincerely and truthfully</b>

628
00:34:32.420 --> 00:34:34.000
<b>declare and confirm</b>

629
00:34:34.000 --> 00:34:35.870
<b>that all the testimony I give will be the truth.</b>

630
00:34:35.880 --> 00:34:36.210
<b>that all the testimony I give will be the truth.</b>

631
00:34:36.210 --> 00:34:38.370
<font size="57"><b>the whole truth and nothing but the truth.</b></font>

632
00:34:38.540 --> 00:34:40.870
<b>Miss Lee Sze-man. as far as you know.</b>

633
00:34:41.420 --> 00:34:43.540
<b>why did Ma Ka-kit plead guilty?</b>

634
00:34:44.080 --> 00:34:46.370
<b>Was he aware of the crime he was confessing to?</b>

635
00:34:46.380 --> 00:34:48.750
<b>Ma Ka-kit wanted a reduced sentence. so he pleaded guilty.</b>

636
00:34:49.380 --> 00:34:52.210
<b>All the documents have his personal signature.</b>

637
00:34:52.540 --> 00:34:55.580
<font size="57"><b>so he was fully aware of the crime he confessed to.</b></font>

638
00:34:55.580 --> 00:34:56.710
<b>Ms. Lee.</b>

639
00:34:56.790 --> 00:35:00.420
<b>do you admit that you misled my client into pleading guilty?</b>

640
00:35:00.630 --> 00:35:02.620
<b>My client committed a crime and wanted a reduced sentence.</b>

641
00:35:02.670 --> 00:35:04.000
<b>I would advise you to plead guilty</b>

642
00:35:04.000 --> 00:35:06.120
<b>because pleading guilty now can reduce your sentence by one-third.</b>

643
00:35:06.290 --> 00:35:08.290
<font size="57"><b>Mr. Lee's advice is the best</b></font>

644
00:35:08.460 --> 00:35:10.580
<b>and quickest way to secure your release.</b>

645
00:35:11.080 --> 00:35:13.290
<b>I was certainly helping him in a lawful manner.</b>

646
00:35:13.290 --> 00:35:16.370
<b>It was you. bitch. who said that if we go to trial.</b>

647
00:35:16.380 --> 00:35:17.620
<b>we will definitely lose!</b>

648
00:35:17.630 --> 00:35:19.040
<b>She is lying in court right now!</b>

649
00:35:19.080 --> 00:35:20.000
<b>Why isn't she being arrested?</b>

650
00:35:20.250 --> 00:35:21.460
<font size="57"><b>Is there no rule of law?</b></font>

651
00:35:22.670 --> 00:35:23.960
<b>Uncle. please show respect to the court.</b>

652
00:35:23.960 --> 00:35:25.370
<b>Otherwise. I will have to ask you to leave.</b>

653
00:35:25.380 --> 00:35:27.750
<b>As a judge. you should ensure fairness!</b>

654
00:35:27.750 --> 00:35:29.290
<b>You don't ensure fairness. and protecting her! Bailiffs!</b>

655
00:35:29.290 --> 00:35:30.790
<b>Please ask this gentleman to leave the court and calm down.</b>

656
00:35:30.830 --> 00:35:32.370
<font size="57"><b>She's lying. and she's not being arrested</b></font>

657
00:35:32.380 --> 00:35:33.540
<b>Is there no rule of law?</b>

658
00:35:34.330 --> 00:35:35.540
<b>Why isn't she being arrested?</b>

659
00:35:36.290 --> 00:35:37.620
<b>Defense counsel for the second defendant.</b>

660
00:35:37.630 --> 00:35:38.750
<b>you may begin your cross-examination.</b>

661
00:35:38.750 --> 00:35:40.170
<b>Thank you. Your Honor.</b>

662
00:35:40.210 --> 00:35:41.040
<b>Ms. Lee.</b>

663
00:35:41.330 --> 00:35:44.000
