00:35:52.210 --> 00:35:53.960
<b>that he did not lend his address to anyone.</b>

669
00:35:53.960 --> 00:35:54.870
<b>In other words.</b>

670
00:35:54.880 --> 00:35:57.830
<font size="57"><b>this case concerns the criminal acts of the first defendant.</b></font>

671
00:35:57.830 --> 00:36:01.580
<b>so my client has been innocent from start to finish.</b>

672
00:36:01.960 --> 00:36:03.330
<b>Do you agree?</b>

673
00:36:03.830 --> 00:36:05.040
<b>You can say that.</b>

674
00:36:06.920 --> 00:36:08.080
<b>Mr. Au Pak-man.</b>

675
00:36:08.460 --> 00:36:10.540
<b>as a former assistant to the defense lawyer.</b>

676
00:36:11.170 --> 00:36:12.670
<b>you have been involved in this case.</b>

677
00:36:12.670 --> 00:36:14.210
<font size="57"><b>Can you describe</b></font>

678
00:36:14.460 --> 00:36:16.290
<b>the relationship between the first defendant and your team?</b>

679
00:36:16.380 --> 00:36:19.670
<b>We had all conversations based on mutual trust.</b>

680
00:36:20.250 --> 00:36:22.500
<b>so the relationship can be described as good.</b>

681
00:36:22.670 --> 00:36:24.710
<b>Your Honor. I have no further questions.</b>

682
00:36:38.080 --> 00:36:38.750
<b>I do.</b>

683
00:36:40.500 --> 00:36:41.370
<b>Prosecutor.</b>

684
00:36:41.710 --> 00:36:43.670
<font size="57"><b>do you want to conduct a second cross-examination?</b></font>

685
00:36:43.710 --> 00:36:44.710
<b>Yes. your Honor.</b>

686
00:36:45.080 --> 00:36:46.460
<b>Mr. Au Pak-man.</b>

687
00:36:47.500 --> 00:36:49.500
<b>the first defendant. Ma Ka-kit.</b>

688
00:36:49.670 --> 00:36:50.830
<b>said that you</b>

689
00:36:51.630 --> 00:36:53.670
<b>and Lawyer Lee Sze-man misled him.</b>

690
00:36:54.290 --> 00:36:55.210
<b>Why did he say that?</b>

691
00:36:55.210 --> 00:36:57.080
<b>Perhaps due to his lack of education.</b>

692
00:36:57.580 --> 00:36:59.460
<font size="57"><b>he is easily influenced</b></font>

693
00:36:59.710 --> 00:37:01.620
<b>and has a naive personality.</b>

694
00:37:01.880 --> 00:37:03.370
<b>He tends to believe what people tell him.</b>

695
00:37:03.540 --> 00:37:05.120
<b>Is it because of his naive nature that</b>

696
00:37:05.130 --> 00:37:06.920
<b>he is easily influenced.</b>

697
00:37:07.790 --> 00:37:08.670
<b>and so you persuaded him to plead guilty?</b>

698
00:37:08.830 --> 00:37:09.710
<b>Prosecutor.</b>

699
00:37:09.880 --> 00:37:11.210
<b>do you know what you are doing?</b>

700
00:37:11.250 --> 00:37:13.420
<font size="57"><b>You're shooting yourself in the foot!</b></font>

701
00:37:13.920 --> 00:37:15.250
<b>This is not a playground!</b>

702
00:37:15.330 --> 00:37:17.460
<b>Your Honor. please do not misunderstand.</b>

703
00:37:17.880 --> 00:37:21.250
<b>I must first understand the character of the first defendant</b>

704
00:37:21.290 --> 00:37:24.370
<b>In order to assess the credibility</b>

705
00:37:24.500 --> 00:37:25.710
<b>of the testimony he provided.</b>

706
00:37:25.790 --> 00:37:28.040
<font size="57"><b>Then please pay attention to the logic of your questioning.</b></font>

707
00:37:28.130 --> 00:37:28.750
<b>all right?</b>

708
00:37:28.750 --> 00:37:30.420
<b>Very well. let me ask in a different way.</b>

709
00:37:30.580 --> 00:37:31.420
<b>Mr. Au.</b>

710
00:37:31.670 --> 00:37:34.040
<b>are you providing free defense for the first defendant?</b>

711
00:37:34.130 --> 00:37:34.790
<b>Yes.</b>

712
00:37:35.250 --> 00:37:37.750
<b>Our law firm has been handling pro bono cases.</b>

713
00:37:37.750 --> 00:37:39.960
<font size="57"><b>Pro bono cases refer to cases where you provide free defense for individuals.</b></font>

714
00:37:39.960 --> 00:37:40.830
<b>That's the usual understanding.</b>

715
00:37:40.830 --> 00:37:42.500
<b>Would you first establish</b>

716
00:37:42.500 --> 00:37:44.120
<b>whether the person you are helping for free</b>

717
00:37:44.130 --> 00:37:45.580
<b>is guilty or not guilty?</b>

718
00:37:45.580 --> 00:37:47.080
<b>I disagree with what you just said.</b>

719
00:37:47.460 --> 00:37:49.370
<b>Even if Ma Ka-kit is truly guilty.</b>

720
00:37:49.630 --> 00:37:51.000
<font size="57"><b>I would still advocate for leniency for him.</b></font>

721
00:37:51.000 --> 00:37:52.370
<b>So you told him to plead guilty.</b>

722
00:37:52.670 --> 00:37:56.170
<b>In my opinion. all young people are inherently good.</b>

723
00:37:57.040 --> 00:37:58.870
<b>Even if Ma Ka-kit is guilty.</b>

724
00:37:58.880 --> 00:38:00.420
<b>he should be given a chance.</b>

725
00:38:00.420 --> 00:38:03.330
<b>So. if the court were to find him guilty today.</b>

726
00:38:03.330 --> 00:38:04.960
<b>I would hope for a lenient sentence.</b>

727
00:38:04.960 --> 00:38:05.750
<font size="57"><b>Objection!</b></font>

728
00:38:06.500 --> 00:38:08.460
<b>I object to the witness implying guilt on my client's behalf.</b>

729
00:38:08.540 --> 00:38:10.120
<b>What are you objecting to?</b>

730
00:38:10.130 --> 00:38:12.080
<b>He is advocating for leniency for your client.</b>

731
00:38:12.210 --> 00:38:13.040
<b>Objection overruled.</b>

732
00:38:15.000 --> 00:38:17.580
<b>Your Honor. allow me to finish my question.</b>

733
00:38:17.920 --> 00:38:20.120
<b>Mr. Au. let me ask you again.</b>

734
00:38:20.830 --> 00:38:22.620
<font size="57"><b>Did you advise the first defendant</b></font>

735
00:38:22.710 --> 00:38:25.040
<b>to take responsibility for a crime he didn't commit?</b>

736
00:38:25.210 --> 00:38:27.210
<b>I don't know how to answer</b>

737
00:38:27.330 --> 00:38:28.420
<b>such a leading question.</b>

738
00:38:28.420 --> 00:38:29.620
<b>The witness doesn't need to answer.</b>

739
00:38:29.630 --> 00:38:32.330
<b>Prosecutor. are you shooting yourself in the foot again?</b>

740
00:38:32.330 --> 00:38:33.290
<b>What are you doing?</b>

741
00:38:33.290 --> 00:38:35.170
<font size="57"><b>With all due respect. Your Honour.</b></font>

742
00:38:35.540 --> 00:38:36.710
<b>I respectfully request you to consider this.</b>

743
00:38:36.710 --> 00:38:38.790
<b>The jury should consider it. Everyone should consider it.</b>

744
00:38:38.790 --> 00:38:41.580
<b>If the first defendant can receive a reduced sentence by pleading guilty.</b>

745
00:38:41.580 --> 00:38:43.290
<b>and he has already pleaded guilty. then it's settled.</b>

746
00:38:43.290 --> 00:38:45.000
<b>Why would he overturn his own testimony</b>

747
00:38:45.000 --> 00:38:46.750
<font size="57"><b>and his guilty plea?</b></font>

748
00:38:47.670 --> 00:38:48.960
<b>There is no logic!</b>

749
00:38:49.130 --> 00:38:50.750
<b>So I have reason</b>

750
00:38:50.750 --> 00:38:53.710
<b>to question the evidence provided by the two witnesses.</b>

751
00:38:56.460 --> 00:38:57.830
<b>Prosecutor.</b>

752
00:38:58.000 --> 00:39:01.420
<b>are you trying to turn your witnesses into hostile witnesses?</b>

753
00:39:01.420 --> 00:39:02.250
<b>Your Honor.</b>

754
00:39:02.420 --> 00:39:05.000
<font size="57"><b>I just want fairness. justice and to objectively assist the court.</b></font>

755
00:39:05.000 --> 00:39:07.170
<b>and to find the truth.</b>

756
00:39:07.380 --> 00:39:08.710
<b>I have no more questions.</b>

757
00:39:16.460 --> 00:39:17.790
<b>Mr. Au.</b>

758
00:39:19.040 --> 00:39:20.870
<b>when the first defendant Ma Ka-kit</b>

759
00:39:20.880 --> 00:39:22.330
<b>initially pleaded guilty.</b>

760
00:39:22.330 --> 00:39:24.960
<b>did he submit three letters requesting leniency?</b>

761
00:39:26.040 --> 00:39:26.870
<b>Yes.</b>

762
00:39:27.460 --> 00:39:30.460
<font size="57"><b>We submitted those documents to the court.</b></font>

763
00:39:30.670 --> 00:39:32.670
<b>hoping they would be considered towards a reduced sentence.</b>

764
00:39:32.670 --> 00:39:34.670
<b>The court has archived all three letters.</b>

765
00:39:34.750 --> 00:39:36.250
<b>andeveryone can review them carefully.</b>

766
00:39:36.380 --> 00:39:37.370
<b>The first letter</b>

767
00:39:37.380 --> 00:39:40.080
<b>was written by an executive director of a listed company.</b>

768
00:39:40.630 --> 00:39:43.290
<font size="57"><b>Mr. Au. have you ever considered or had doubts about how</b></font>

769
00:39:43.290 --> 00:39:46.460
<b>and under what circumstances the first defendant. Ma Ka-kit.</b>

770
00:39:46.460 --> 00:39:47.710
<b>would know</b>

771
00:39:47.710 --> 00:39:49.170
<b>or have the opportunity to know</b>

772
00:39:49.170 --> 00:39:51.330
<b>an executive director of a listed company?</b>

773
00:39:51.420 --> 00:39:53.080
<b>As his legal team.</b>

774
00:39:53.170 --> 00:39:55.750
<b>even if we have doubts. we must act in good faith...</b>

775
00:39:55.960 --> 00:39:56.870
<font size="57"><b>Understood.</b></font>

776
00:39:56.880 --> 00:39:59.710
<b>The second letter was written by a social worker.</b>

777
00:40:00.250 --> 00:40:04.080
<b>stating that Ma Ka-kit had often participated in volunteer activities.</b>

778
00:40:04.380 --> 00:40:05.540
<b>However. upon further investigation.</b>

779
00:40:05.540 --> 00:40:06.920
<b>the organization stated that</b>

780
00:40:07.040 --> 00:40:10.000
<b>they never organized the activities mentioned in the letter.</b>

781
00:40:10.080 --> 00:40:11.540
<font size="57"><b>What are your thoughts. Mr. Au?</b></font>

782
00:40:11.540 --> 00:40:12.870
<b>think it would be inappropriate for me to comment.</b>

783
00:40:12.960 --> 00:40:14.040
<b>Your Honor.</b>

784
00:40:14.080 --> 00:40:15.960
<b>I believe you should not allow</b>

785
00:40:16.250 --> 00:40:18.330
<b>the defense lawyer to continue his questioning regarding these letters.</b>

786
00:40:18.330 --> 00:40:20.620
<b>as they are irrelevant to the case.</b>

787
00:40:20.750 --> 00:40:22.420
<b>I agree. Your Honor.</b>

788
00:40:23.380 --> 00:40:24.500
<font size="57"><b>Sit down.</b></font>

789
00:40:25.880 --> 00:40:27.120
<b>Mr. Ho. continue.</b>

790
00:40:27.420 --> 00:40:28.370
<b>Thank you. your Honor.</b>

791
00:40:28.380 --> 00:40:29.460
<b>The final letter</b>

792
00:40:29.750 --> 00:40:33.370
<b>was claimed by Ma Ka-kit to be written by his former boss.</b>

793
00:40:33.380 --> 00:40:35.870
<b>It states that he is a diligent and honest person.</b>

794
00:40:36.290 --> 00:40:39.870
<b>The letter mentions that his employment started in December 2019.</b>

795
00:40:40.130 --> 00:40:43.460
<font size="57"><b>but that company had already been liquidated in 2017.</b></font>

796
00:40:43.830 --> 00:40:47.210
<b>so this letter was actually forged by Ma Ka-kit.</b>

797
00:40:47.330 --> 00:40:48.870
<b>These letters of support were arranged by them.</b>

798
00:40:48.880 --> 00:40:49.920
<b>what does it have to do with me?</b>

799
00:40:50.000 --> 00:40:50.870
<b>Your Honor.</b>

800
00:40:51.130 --> 00:40:53.620
<b>I would like to respectfully submit regarding</b>

801
00:40:53.790 --> 00:40:55.290
<b>what the defense lawyer just said.</b>

802
00:40:55.380 --> 00:40:58.710
<font size="57"><b>Until the authenticity of these three leniency letters is confirmed.</b></font>

803
00:40:58.960 --> 00:41:01.540
<b>the defense lawyer's hasty attack on the first defendant.</b>

804
00:41:01.540 --> 00:41:04.080
<b>is surely damaging the integrity of the first defendant?</b>

805
00:41:04.080 --> 00:41:05.460
<b>Objection. you Honor. Your Honor...</b>

806
00:41:05.460 --> 00:41:06.500
<b>Your Honor. I object.</b>

807
00:41:06.500 --> 00:41:08.790
<b>I request a 15-minute recess.</b>

808
00:41:08.830 --> 00:41:09.960
<font size="57"><b>I haven't done anything!</b></font>

809
00:41:09.960 --> 00:41:11.580
<b>Your Honor. I also want to remind you</b>

810
00:41:11.580 --> 00:41:13.290
<b>that if these three letters</b>

811
00:41:13.290 --> 00:41:15.460
<b>could possibly have been forged.</b>

812
00:41:15.460 --> 00:41:17.080
<b>they cannot be used as evidence.</b>

813
00:41:17.080 --> 00:41:18.960
<b>Prosecutor Fok. what exactly do you want?</b>

814
00:41:20.210 --> 00:41:22.250
<b>Defense is my responsibility. what are you trying to do?</b>

815
00:41:22.580 --> 00:41:23.460
<font size="57"><b>Mr. Cheng.</b></font>

816
00:41:23.460 --> 00:41:25.790
<b>you said your client was misled by someone.</b>

817
00:41:26.080 --> 00:41:27.250
<b>Is that just a theory?</b>

818
00:41:27.630 --> 00:41:28.460
<b>Do you have any evidence?</b>

819
00:41:28.460 --> 00:41:30.210
<b>I don't have evidence to prove that he was misled.</b>

820
00:41:30.250 --> 00:41:32.750
<b>but there is also no evidence to prove that he wasn't misled.</b>

821
00:41:32.830 --> 00:41:35.040
<b>Mr. Cheng. My learned friend.</b>

822
00:41:35.460 --> 00:41:36.790
<font size="57"><b>My learned friend.</b></font>

823
00:41:36.880 --> 00:41:38.500
<b>Could you please be more professional?</b>

824
00:41:38.880 --> 00:41:43.000
<b>You should help your client find evidence.</b>

825
00:41:43.000 --> 00:41:44.960
<b>If you can't find evidence. find witnesses.</b>

826
00:41:45.250 --> 00:41:46.620
<b>You are useless.</b>

827
00:41:46.630 --> 00:41:47.710
<b>You are talking nonsense.</b>

828
00:41:47.710 --> 00:41:49.420
<b>How do you even practice as a defence lawyer?</b>

829
00:41:50.750 --> 00:41:52.330
<b>Mr. Bao.</b>

830
00:41:52.460 --> 00:41:54.420
<font size="57"><b>this prosecutor of yours</b></font>

831
00:41:54.670 --> 00:41:59.250
<b>is constantly asking questions beneficial to the defendant.</b>

832
00:41:59.500 --> 00:42:01.540
<b>This is completely illogical!</b>

833
00:42:01.880 --> 00:42:04.170
<b>And he's openly insulting</b>

834
00:42:04.290 --> 00:42:06.080
<b>the opposing lawyer in court.</b>

835
00:42:06.630 --> 00:42:08.790
<b>Totally ridiculous!</b>

836
00:42:09.540 --> 00:42:11.790
<b>If you can't control your people.</b>

837
00:42:11.790 --> 00:42:13.960
<font size="57"><b>I will sue you for contempt of court.</b></font>

838
00:42:14.040 --> 00:42:14.870
<b>Your Honor.</b>

839
00:42:14.880 --> 00:42:16.250
<b>Mr. Fok is not being contemptuous.</b>

840
00:42:16.250 --> 00:42:18.540
<b>He just wants to employ a creative questioning approach.</b>

841
00:42:18.540 --> 00:42:21.000
<b>Your Honor. it has nothing to do with Prosecutor Bao.</b>

842
00:42:21.000 --> 00:42:24.000
<b>I hope you can carefully examine</b>

843
00:42:24.000 --> 00:42:25.540
<b>whether Ma Ka-kit was truly misled or not.</b>

844
00:42:25.540 --> 00:42:26.710
<font size="57"><b>Mr Fok.</b></font>

845
00:42:26.710 --> 00:42:28.250
<b>when I was in your position.</b>

846
00:42:28.250 --> 00:42:29.670
<b>you were still wearing diapers.</b>

847
00:42:29.670 --> 00:42:31.170
<b>I remind you that</b>

848
00:42:31.170 --> 00:42:34.370
<b>you are in no position to teach me how to see clearly.</b>

849
00:42:34.630 --> 00:42:36.790
<b>On the contrary. I should be teaching you how to see clearly.</b>

850
00:42:36.790 --> 00:42:38.330
<b>As the prosecutor.</b>

851
00:42:38.330 --> 00:42:40.540
<font size="57"><b>defending the defendant is not your responsibility!</b></font>

852
00:42:40.540 --> 00:42:41.580
<b>So come back</b>

853
00:42:42.330 --> 00:42:43.750
<b>Your Honor. I apologize.</b>

854
00:42:43.920 --> 00:42:45.540
<b>but I would like to kindly remind you</b>

855
00:42:45.540 --> 00:42:47.040
<b>that our duty in criminal prosecution</b>

856
00:42:47.040 --> 00:42:50.080
<b>is not solely to ensure the defendant's conviction.</b>

857
00:42:50.170 --> 00:42:53.120
<b>but to present credible evidence</b>

858
00:42:53.330 --> 00:42:57.250
<font size="57"><b>of the crimes we are prosecuting to the jury.</b></font>

859
00:42:57.250 --> 00:42:59.040
<b>Are you teaching me how to do my job again?</b>

860
00:43:00.670 --> 00:43:02.670
<b>Should I take off my robe and give it to you to wear?</b>

861
00:43:02.880 --> 00:43:03.870
<b>Or give you a judge's wig to put on?</b>

862
00:43:03.880 --> 00:43:05.710
<b>Your Honor. what I mean is that your actions</b>

863
00:43:05.710 --> 00:43:08.500
<b>have already influenced the jury's perception of the first defendant.</b>

864
00:43:08.500 --> 00:43:11.120
<font size="57"><b>So I request that you immediately dismiss the jury</b></font>

865
00:43:11.130 --> 00:43:12.620
<b>and order a retrial.</b>

866
00:43:18.080 --> 00:43:18.830
<b>Court is adjourned.</b>

867
00:43:19.380 --> 00:43:20.040
<b>Court!</b>

868
00:43:28.210 --> 00:43:29.290
<b>I'm lost for words.</b>

869
00:43:33.290 --> 00:43:34.460
<b>Have some coffee.</b>

870
00:43:35.670 --> 00:43:36.370
<b>Thanks.</b>

871
00:43:38.500 --> 00:43:40.040
<b>You need to assess the situation.</b>

872
00:43:40.540 --> 00:43:41.620
<b>It's like a police baton.</b>

873
00:43:41.790 --> 00:43:42.790
<font size="57"><b>Only extend when necessary.</b></font>

874
00:43:42.920 --> 00:43:44.210
<b>and retract when unnecessary.</b>

875
00:43:44.210 --> 00:43:46.670
<b>If you keep it extended all the time. you'll suffer.</b>

876
00:43:48.880 --> 00:43:50.870
<b>At 3:30. I want to watch your trial.</b>

877
00:43:51.290 --> 00:43:52.670
<b>Won't you stay to see the verdict?</b>

878
00:43:52.920 --> 00:43:54.170
<b>It doesn't matter if I watch it.</b>

879
00:44:01.710 --> 00:44:03.830
<b>We need to remember that there must be a majority consensus</b>

880
00:44:03.830 --> 00:44:05.170
<font size="57"><b>for a ruling to be valid.</b></font>

881
00:44:05.170 --> 00:44:08.460
<b>It can be 7-0. 6-1. or 5-2. okay.</b>

882
00:44:08.460 --> 00:44:11.000
<b>If it's 4-3. there'll be a retrial.</b>

883
00:44:11.000 --> 00:44:11.920
<b>Mr. Fok.</b>

884
00:44:13.540 --> 00:44:15.750
<b>the courtroom is truly a strange place.</b>

885
00:44:15.880 --> 00:44:18.750
<b>A bunch of people who understand the law are fighting here.</b>

886
00:44:18.750 --> 00:44:21.370
<b>It's left to seven people who don't understand the law to determine life and death.</b>

887
00:44:21.540 --> 00:44:23.080
<font size="57"><b>But you did well just now.</b></font>

888
00:44:23.080 --> 00:44:24.580
<b>Don't worry too much about the outcome.</b>

889
00:44:24.670 --> 00:44:26.870
<b>We all have one goal. and that is to help Kit.</b>

890
00:44:26.880 --> 00:44:28.960
<b>Mr. Au. cut the teullshit.</b>

891
00:44:29.500 --> 00:44:30.710
<b>Chief Juror.</b>

892
00:44:30.710 --> 00:44:32.540
<b>has a verdict been reached?</b>

893
00:44:32.790 --> 00:44:33.290
<b>Yes.</b>

894
00:44:34.290 --> 00:44:35.870
<b>Is the verdict unanimous?</b>

895
00:44:36.170 --> 00:44:36.830
<b>No.</b>

896
00:44:36.960 --> 00:44:38.170
<font size="57"><b>Was it a significant majority?</b></font>

897
00:44:38.710 --> 00:44:39.420
<b>Yes.</b>

898
00:44:39.750 --> 00:44:41.540
<b>What was the vote result?</b>

899
00:44:42.460 --> 00:44:42.870
<b>5-2.</b>

900
00:44:43.500 --> 00:44:46.120
<b>Is the first defendant guilty or not guilty?</b>

901
00:44:46.210 --> 00:44:47.250
<b>Guilty.</b>

902
00:44:47.250 --> 00:44:50.040
<b>Is the second defendant guilty or not guilty?</b>

903
00:44:50.670 --> 00:44:51.540
<b>Not guilty.</b>

904
00:44:53.000 --> 00:44:54.710
<b>It was you who misled that young man. right?</b>

905
00:44:55.420 --> 00:44:57.620
<font size="57"><b>You pushed Ma Ka-kit into hell. didn't you?</b></font>

906
00:45:00.670 --> 00:45:02.210
<b>I will now pronounce the sentence.</b>

907
00:45:03.000 --> 00:45:06.120
<b>The first defendant. Ma Ka-kit.</b>

908
00:45:06.210 --> 00:45:07.540
<b>is guilty of drug trafficking.</b>

909
00:45:08.080 --> 00:45:10.620
<b>Due to his lack of remorse</b>

910
00:45:10.710 --> 00:45:12.170
<b>and the waste of court resources.</b>

911
00:45:12.170 --> 00:45:13.250
<b>he must be severely punished.</b>

912
00:45:15.250 --> 00:45:16.460
<b>He is sentenced to</b>

913
00:45:16.460 --> 00:45:17.540
<font size="57"><b>27 years in prison.</b></font>

914
00:45:19.130 --> 00:45:22.120
<b>The second defendant. Chan Kwok-wing. is acquitted and released.</b>

915
00:45:24.380 --> 00:45:24.920
<b>Court is adjourned.</b>

916
00:45:24.920 --> 00:45:25.580
<b>Court!</b>

917
00:45:29.460 --> 00:45:30.120
<b>Kit.</b>

918
00:45:30.500 --> 00:45:31.670
<b>you have to stay strong</b>

919
00:45:32.250 --> 00:45:32.580
<b>Kit!</b>

920
00:45:33.170 --> 00:45:34.460
<b>Kit! You...</b>

921
00:45:34.670 --> 00:45:36.330
<b>Grandpa...</b>

922
00:45:36.380 --> 00:45:37.370
<b>Don't you worry!</b>

923
00:45:37.830 --> 00:45:40.830
<font size="57"><b>Grandpa won't let you sit in prison for 27 years.</b></font>

924
00:45:40.830 --> 00:45:43.920
<b>I wouldn't be alive to see you released!</b>

925
00:45:44.170 --> 00:45:45.540
<b>Don't worry!</b>

926
00:45:46.130 --> 00:45:47.040
<b>I'll find a way!</b>

927
00:46:25.130 --> 00:46:26.080
<b>Sorry.</b>

928
00:46:31.580 --> 00:46:33.790
<b>Believe me. I will help you.</b>

929
00:46:34.670 --> 00:46:37.170
<b>The court sentenced me to 27 years.</b>

930
00:46:41.380 --> 00:46:42.830
<b>How are you going to help me?</b>

931
00:46:54.170 --> 00:46:54.920
<font size="57"><b>Mr. Au. good morning.</b></font>

932
00:46:55.000 --> 00:46:55.580
<b>Morning.</b>

933
00:46:56.500 --> 00:46:57.080
<b>Madam Cheung.</b>

934
00:46:58.250 --> 00:46:58.920
<b>Debbie.</b>

935
00:46:59.580 --> 00:47:00.580
<b>Hello. Ah Man.</b>

936
00:47:01.040 --> 00:47:02.120
<b>Let me introduce</b>

937
00:47:02.290 --> 00:47:03.170
<b>Counsel Lee.</b>

938
00:47:03.210 --> 00:47:04.500
<b>She specializes in commercial fraud cases.</b>

939
00:47:04.500 --> 00:47:05.710
<b>She can definitely help you.</b>

940
00:47:06.380 --> 00:47:07.710
<font size="57"><b>You can trust me with your lawsuit.</b></font>

941
00:47:09.170 --> 00:47:09.710
<b>you're back?</b>

942
00:47:09.710 --> 00:47:10.370
<b>Let me go first.</b>

943
00:47:11.040 --> 00:47:13.040
<b>I've taken on an additional ciwbl case.</b>

944
00:47:13.170 --> 00:47:14.870
<b>It's a piece of cake for you.</b>

945
00:47:14.880 --> 00:47:17.540
<b>Last time you mentioned wanting a 10-carat diamond.</b>

946
00:47:17.790 --> 00:47:20.170
<b>I found a good one for you in Belgium. Flawless.</b>

947
00:47:20.170 --> 00:47:22.420
<font size="57"><b>Why do clients come to us?</b></font>

948
00:47:23.290 --> 00:47:24.750
<b>Because they feel helpless.</b>

949
00:47:25.040 --> 00:47:27.290
<b>Just like sick people going to see a doctor.</b>

950
00:47:27.670 --> 00:47:29.420
<b>or guilty ones going to church for confession.</b>

951
00:47:29.420 --> 00:47:30.960
<b>or going to a witch to curse someone.</b>

952
00:47:30.960 --> 00:47:32.080
<b>It's all the same.</b>

953
00:47:33.250 --> 00:47:34.670
<b>But you're different.</b>

954
00:47:35.250 --> 00:47:36.250
<b>because you understand the law.</b>

955
00:47:36.500 --> 00:47:37.750
<font size="57"><b>You're their savior.</b></font>

956
00:47:46.290 --> 00:47:48.960
<b>It's all thanks to your selfless efforts</b>

957
00:47:49.170 --> 00:47:50.460
<b>and working through many late nights tirelessly.</b>

958
00:47:50.580 --> 00:47:53.500
<b>that the Department of Justice can uphold the rule of law for society.</b>

959
00:47:53.630 --> 00:47:57.750
<b>But there are still many crises and challenges.</b>

960
00:47:58.040 --> 00:47:59.920
<b>I hope everyone stays committed to their roles</b>

961
00:48:00.040 --> 00:48:02.830
<font size="57"><b>and continues to uphold justice for the citizens.</b></font>

962
00:48:07.790 --> 00:48:10.210
<b>thank you for taking care of our colleagues.</b>

963
00:48:10.210 --> 00:48:11.420
<b>You're welcome. Director.</b>

964
00:48:11.580 --> 00:48:12.540
<b>Fok Chi-ho.</b>

965
00:48:13.420 --> 00:48:14.120
<b>Hello. Director.</b>

966
00:48:14.130 --> 00:48:16.420
<b>Welcome to the Department of Justice family.</b>

967
00:48:16.960 --> 00:48:18.960
<b>When you were in the police force.</b>

968
00:48:18.960 --> 00:48:21.670
<font size="57"><b>you were famous for catching criminals</b></font>

969
00:48:22.000 --> 00:48:23.420
<b>and working diligently.</b>

970
00:48:23.500 --> 00:48:25.170
<b>We believe that</b>

971
00:48:25.290 --> 00:48:26.960
<b>with your experience as a police officer.</b>

972
00:48:26.960 --> 00:48:29.540
<b>you can provide us with a different perspective.</b>

973
00:48:29.670 --> 00:48:32.250
<b>Now Mr.Yeung. here. has vast experience.</b>

974
00:48:32.290 --> 00:48:33.500
<b>If you have any questions.</b>

975
00:48:33.500 --> 00:48:36.040
<font size="57"><b>he can definitely give you appropriate guidance.</b></font>

976
00:48:36.040 --> 00:48:37.370
<b>You should work together closely.</b>

977
00:48:37.710 --> 00:48:38.710
<b>Absolutely! I hope so.</b>

978
00:48:38.710 --> 00:48:40.370
<b>I will do my best to assist Mr. Fok.</b>

979
00:48:40.460 --> 00:48:41.960
<b>He's very smart. Rest assured. there shouldn't be any problems.</b>

980
00:48:41.960 --> 00:48:42.830
<b>Director.</b>

981
00:48:42.830 --> 00:48:43.710
<b>I know.</b>

982
00:48:43.710 --> 00:48:46.420
<font size="57"><b>Prosecutor Fok has some doubts about this first case.</b></font>

983
00:48:46.540 --> 00:48:47.920
<b>but as the prosecution.</b>

984
00:48:48.040 --> 00:48:49.290
<b>even if we see issues.</b>

985
00:48:49.380 --> 00:48:52.040
<b>only the defense can file an appeal.</b>

986
00:48:52.250 --> 00:48:55.460
<b>At this stage. there isn't much the Department of Justice can do.</b>

987
00:48:55.920 --> 00:48:56.960
<b>I understand. Director.</b>

988
00:48:57.040 --> 00:48:57.920
<b>However. hypothetically speaking.</b>

989
00:48:58.380 --> 00:48:59.920
<font size="57"><b>if the defendant... just hypothetically.</b></font>

990
00:49:00.920 --> 00:49:02.830
<b>requests an appeal.</b>

991
00:49:02.960 --> 00:49:04.540
<b>I would really hope that you. as Director.</b>

992
00:49:04.630 --> 00:49:05.710
<b>personally pay attention to this case.</b>

993
00:49:05.710 --> 00:49:08.080
<b>Mr. Fok. I'm curious why you</b>

994
00:49:08.580 --> 00:49:10.290
<b>are so eager for the defendant to appeal?</b>

995
00:49:10.880 --> 00:49:13.710
<b>The court has already made a clear judgment.</b>

996
00:49:13.710 --> 00:49:15.620
<font size="57"><b>so I want to know what the issue is.</b></font>

997
00:49:16.000 --> 00:49:19.000
<b>or are you just intent on seeing the DOJ lose a lawsuit?</b>

998
00:49:20.210 --> 00:49:21.870
<b>These kinds of discussions</b>

999
00:49:21.880 --> 00:49:23.080
<b>should be part of your daily work.</b>

1000
00:49:23.290 --> 00:49:24.620
<b>You may continue them another time.</b>

1001
00:49:25.000 --> 00:49:27.960
<b>but today. there's a most important task to complete.</b>

1002
00:49:32.250 --> 00:49:33.000
<b>Hello. George!</b>

1003
00:49:33.250 --> 00:49:34.170
<font size="57"><b>Hi. Selina.</b></font>

1004
00:49:34.880 --> 00:49:35.420
<b>Selina.</b>

1005
00:49:35.540 --> 00:49:36.370
<b>Long time. no see.</b>

1006
00:49:36.540 --> 00:49:38.960
<b>Do you remember? Next month. we have</b>

1007
00:49:39.130 --> 00:49:41.170
<b>our alumni golf tournament. You're on my team!</b>

1008
00:49:41.290 --> 00:49:42.330
<b>Come early so we can take some photos.</b>

1009
00:49:42.380 --> 00:49:43.580
<b>Alright.</b>

1010
00:49:44.630 --> 00:49:45.790
<b>Everyone. come over here.</b>

1011
00:49:45.920 --> 00:49:46.830
<b>We have a full house today.</b>

1012
00:49:46.830 --> 00:49:47.500
<font size="57"><b>Yes.</b></font>

1013
00:49:47.960 --> 00:49:48.710
<b>Please have a seat.</b>

1014
00:49:48.710 --> 00:49:49.250
<b>Grand Judge.</b>

1015
00:49:49.750 --> 00:49:50.370
<b>Please. sit.</b>

1016
00:49:50.540 --> 00:49:51.040
<b>Mr. Yeung!</b>

1017
00:49:51.250 --> 00:49:52.500
<b>Grand Judge. Mr. Bao.</b>

1018
00:49:53.750 --> 00:49:54.500
<b>Grand Judge.</b>

1019
00:49:56.290 --> 00:49:57.040
<b>Please sit!</b>

1020
00:49:59.830 --> 00:50:02.920
<b>Director. your subordinate also calls me 'Grand Judge'.</b>

1021
00:50:02.920 --> 00:50:03.830
<b>He doesn't know the rules.</b>

1022
00:50:04.080 --> 00:50:06.960
<font size="57"><b>Everyone present here can call me 'Grand Judge'.</b></font>

1023
00:50:06.960 --> 00:50:08.420
<b>except for you.</b>

1024
00:50:08.960 --> 00:50:09.750
<b>Right. Mr. Yeung?</b>

1025
00:50:12.080 --> 00:50:13.790
<b>Before 1997.</b>

1026
00:50:14.420 --> 00:50:17.330
<b>all the judges in the higher courts were called</b>

1027
00:50:17.330 --> 00:50:18.460
<b>'Grand Judge.'</b>

1028
00:50:18.460 --> 00:50:20.000
<b>That's why they called me 'Grand Judge'.</b>

1029
00:50:20.000 --> 00:50:22.500
<b>After 1997. they simplified the title to 'Judge'</b>

1030
00:50:22.500 --> 00:50:23.710
<font size="57"><b>without the 'Grand'.</b></font>

1031
00:50:23.750 --> 00:50:24.960
<b>So.</b>

1032
00:50:24.960 --> 00:50:27.170
<b>any friends I knew before 1997</b>

1033
00:50:27.210 --> 00:50:28.580
<b>can still call me 'Grand Judge1. which is fine.</b>

1034
00:50:28.790 --> 00:50:31.580
<b>But as for you.</b>

1035
00:50:31.580 --> 00:50:32.830
<b>it's not very suitable. right?</b>

1036
00:50:33.080 --> 00:50:35.420
<b>Thank you for going easy on him.</b>

1037
00:50:35.420 --> 00:50:36.790
<b>I should thank you.</b>

1038
00:50:37.250 --> 00:50:38.710
<b>Marco. pour the wine.</b>

1039
00:50:40.250 --> 00:50:41.540
<font size="57"><b>Mr. Fok.</b></font>

1040
00:50:46.540 --> 00:50:47.620
<b>frankly.</b>

1041
00:50:49.080 --> 00:50:53.370
<b>as a judge. I only consider three rules.</b>

1042
00:50:53.580 --> 00:50:55.250
<b>there's no fourth.</b>

1043
00:50:55.750 --> 00:50:57.710
<b>It's eyewitness testimony. physical evidence.</b>

1044
00:50:57.710 --> 00:50:59.870
<b>and the jury's decision.</b>

1045
00:51:01.580 --> 00:51:02.370
<b>Honestly.</b>

1046
00:51:02.500 --> 00:51:04.830
<b>sometimes</b>

1047
00:51:04.830 --> 00:51:06.790
<b>I know the defendant is guilty.</b>

1048
00:51:06.790 --> 00:51:08.540
<font size="57"><b>but if there's no evidence. I have to let them go.</b></font>

1049
00:51:08.710 --> 00:51:09.540
<b>On the other hand.</b>

1050
00:51:09.710 --> 00:51:12.040
<b>sometimes I know they're innocent.</b>

1051
00:51:12.250 --> 00:51:15.330
<b>but if there seems to be evidence. I have to make a tough judgment.</b>

1052
00:51:15.330 --> 00:51:17.420
<b>This is a historical legacy.</b>

1053
00:51:17.540 --> 00:51:18.620
<b>I have to follow the rules.</b>

1054
00:51:18.630 --> 00:51:19.960
<b>Even as a 'Grand Judge'.</b>

1055
00:51:19.960 --> 00:51:22.000
<font size="57"><b>I have to abide by the rules.</b></font>

1056
00:51:22.250 --> 00:51:24.210
<b>There's no reason for you not to follow them.</b>

1057
00:51:24.210 --> 00:51:25.540
<b>How can you just do as you please?</b>

1058
00:51:25.750 --> 00:51:28.040
<b>But this time. I understand.</b>

1059
00:51:28.040 --> 00:51:30.920
<b>It's your first time working for the Department of Justice.</b>

1060
00:51:31.210 --> 00:51:32.370
<b>and you have no experience.</b>

1061
00:51:32.460 --> 00:51:34.080
<b>I'll forgiive you this time.</b>

1062
00:51:35.170 --> 00:51:37.000
<font size="57"><b>No need to talk shop. Let's drink!</b></font>

1063
00:51:37.750 --> 00:51:40.080
<b>Come on. This bottle of wine is extraordinary.</b>

1064
00:51:40.710 --> 00:51:42.080
<b>It received a score of 100 from Parker!</b>

1065
00:51:42.080 --> 00:51:44.120
<b>It's a 1992 Chateau Leblanc.</b>

1066
00:51:45.040 --> 00:51:45.870
<b>Let's all try it!</b>

1067
00:51:45.880 --> 00:51:47.040
<b>I bought it at an auction in France.</b>

1068
00:51:48.330 --> 00:51:51.670
<b>In 1982. this lady was abandoned by her husband and they divorced.</b>

1069
00:51:51.670 --> 00:51:54.750
<font size="57"><b>While she was making the wine. she was stamping on those grapes.</b></font>

1070
00:51:54.750 --> 00:51:57.710
<b>crying the whole time. Her tears fell into the grape juice.</b>

1071
00:51:57.750 --> 00:51:59.120
<b>So now. when you-drink it.</b>

1072
00:51:59.130 --> 00:52:01.420
<b>there's a taste of her sorrow.</b>

1073
00:52:01.500 --> 00:52:03.670
<b>Let's all drink and see if there's a hint of sadness.</b>

1074
00:52:10.670 --> 00:52:11.500
<b>Mr. Fok.</b>

1075
00:52:11.670 --> 00:52:13.330
<b>can you taste the sadness?</b>

1076
00:52:15.790 --> 00:52:17.460
<font size="57"><b>A botile of wine that costs tens of thousands.</b></font>

1077
00:52:17.460 --> 00:52:18.620
<b>even a glass costs thousands...</b>

1078
00:52:18.790 --> 00:52:21.670
<b>Yes.</b>

1079
00:52:21.670 --> 00:52:26.000
<b>It's the monthly income of a poor family in Hong Kong.</b>

1080
00:52:26.710 --> 00:52:29.500
<b>Indeed. that's quite sorrowful.</b>

1081
00:52:34.750 --> 00:52:37.540
<b>I like your sense of humor.</b>

1082
00:52:38.000 --> 00:52:38.870
<b>You're a smart guy!</b>

1083
00:52:58.630 --> 00:52:59.290
<b>Uncle Ma.</b>

1084
00:53:01.170 --> 00:53:02.920
<font size="57"><b>You played a part in getting my grandson imprisoned!</b></font>

1085
00:53:02.920 --> 00:53:03.750
<b>Why are you looking for me?</b>

1086
00:53:03.750 --> 00:53:05.040
<b>I understand how you feel.</b>

1087
00:53:05.500 --> 00:53:06.870
<b>Can you give me a few minutes?</b>

1088
00:53:07.080 --> 00:53:07.920
<b>I want to say something.</b>

1089
00:53:08.500 --> 00:53:10.960
<b>There have been many loopholes in this case.</b>

1090
00:53:11.250 --> 00:53:13.040
<b>On behalf of the Department of Justice.</b>

1091
00:53:13.250 --> 00:53:14.670
<font size="57"><b>I apologize to you.</b></font>

1092
00:53:16.710 --> 00:53:19.420
<b>Additionally. I want to remind you that</b>

1093
00:53:20.130 --> 00:53:23.170
<b>as a citizen. you have the right to exercise your civil rights</b>

1094
00:53:23.420 --> 00:53:24.330
<b>and file an appeal.</b>

1095
00:53:24.330 --> 00:53:25.290
<b>No need for your reminder.</b>

1096
00:53:25.920 --> 00:53:27.120
<b>I have already applied for it.</b>

1097
00:53:27.290 --> 00:53:28.370
<b>That lawyer Cheng told me.</b>

1098
00:53:28.380 --> 00:53:31.040
<font size="57"><b>He also told me not to talk to anyone during this time.</b></font>

1099
00:53:31.210 --> 00:53:32.420
<b>Yes. Don't mess with me!</b>

1100
00:53:32.460 --> 00:53:33.580
<b>I hope you believe me.</b>

1101
00:53:35.210 --> 00:53:37.460
<b>Our society has the rule... Pretending to be good guys.</b>

1102
00:53:37.830 --> 00:53:39.500
<b>I don't believe any of your nonsense!</b>

1103
00:53:41.460 --> 00:53:43.870
<b>I don't believe you. double-crosser!</b>

1104
00:53:44.210 --> 00:53:46.210
<b>You're all pretending to be the good guys!</b>

1105
00:54:45.830 --> 00:54:46.830
<font size="57"><b>Help!</b></font>

1106
00:54:47.080 --> 00:54:47.870
<b>Help me!</b>

1107
00:55:49.380 --> 00:55:50.790
<b>We have finished recording Uncle Ma's statement.</b>

1108
00:55:51.250 --> 00:55:53.500
<b>He just applied for an appeal. and now he's been attacked.</b>

1109
00:55:53.830 --> 00:55:57.290
<b>It's likely related to those two lawyers.</b>

1110
00:55:57.920 --> 00:56:00.080
<b>We recently seized several vehicles transporting drugs.</b>

1111
00:56:00.330 --> 00:56:03.290
<b>and your case is also related to drug trafficking.</b>

1112
00:56:03.380 --> 00:56:04.370
<font size="57"><b>You should take care.</b></font>

1113
00:56:11.880 --> 00:56:13.580
<b>Really. you don't have to accompany me.</b>

1114
00:56:14.130 --> 00:56:15.500
<b>I can go back home by myself.</b>

1115
00:56:15.750 --> 00:56:17.620
<b>No problem. It's on my way.</b>

1116
00:56:20.710 --> 00:56:22.870
<b>There's so much junk here. Be careful.</b>

1117
00:56:25.130 --> 00:56:26.750
<b>This is my humble abode. Excuse the mess!</b>

1118
00:56:27.130 --> 00:56:28.920
<b>Please sit!</b>

1119
00:56:30.920 --> 00:56:32.580
<font size="57"><b>I'll open the window to let some fresh air in.</b></font>

1120
00:56:36.380 --> 00:56:37.500
<b>Let me get you something to drink.</b>

1121
00:56:40.540 --> 00:56:41.210
<b>Damn!</b>

1122
00:56:42.000 --> 00:56:43.420
<b>Ran away again!</b>

1123
00:56:44.580 --> 00:56:45.710
<b>Please have some tea.</b>

1124
00:56:45.830 --> 00:56:46.500
<b>Thanks.</b>

1125
00:56:54.080 --> 00:56:56.210
<b>Whenever it's pouring outside.</b>

1126
00:56:56.210 --> 00:56:57.710
<b>it leaks in here.</b>

1127
00:56:58.420 --> 00:57:00.620
<font size="57"><b>Like the old Chinese saying. 'water brings prosperity'. eh?</b></font>

1128
00:57:00.790 --> 00:57:02.920
<b>It'll be alright as long as I don't starve to death.</b>

1129
00:57:12.290 --> 00:57:13.540
<b>Did your grandson paint these pictures?</b>

1130
00:57:13.540 --> 00:57:14.960
<b>Yes. It's Kit who painted them.</b>

1131
00:57:14.960 --> 00:57:16.870
<b>He loves painting tall buildings and</b>

1132
00:57:17.170 --> 00:57:19.500
<b>always says he wants me to live in a better place.</b>

1133
00:57:19.500 --> 00:57:20.710
<font size="57"><b>Once he turns 18.</b></font>

1134
00:57:20.880 --> 00:57:22.540
<b>he'll apply for public housing.</b>

1135
00:57:22.790 --> 00:57:26.920
<b>Hopefully in another twp. years. we'll move into a new apartment together.</b>

1136
00:57:33.960 --> 00:57:34.790
<b>Uncle Ma.</b>

1137
00:57:35.750 --> 00:57:37.420
<b>how do you know Lee Sze-man?</b>

1138
00:57:37.880 --> 00:57:40.500
<b>Through the boss of the restaurant where Kit works.</b>

1139
00:57:40.880 --> 00:57:42.670
<b>I think his last name is 'Lau'.</b>

1140
00:57:43.540 --> 00:57:45.290
<font size="57"><b>He saw how hardworking Kit was</b></font>

1141
00:57:45.290 --> 00:57:46.870
<b>and introduced him to a lawyer.</b>

1142
00:57:46.880 --> 00:57:49.370
<b>Then he introduced us to that bitch</b>

1143
00:57:49.460 --> 00:57:51.000
<b>who offered to help for free.</b>

1144
00:57:51.130 --> 00:57:54.120
<b>We're too poor. We didn't have a choice.</b>

1145
00:57:54.210 --> 00:57:56.830
<b>Just talking to a lawyer costs a few thousand bucks.</b>

1146
00:57:56.920 --> 00:57:58.620
<b>How could I afford it?</b>

1147
00:57:58.790 --> 00:58:00.960
<font size="57"><b>What use are legal aid or the DOJ to folk like us?</b></font>

1148
00:58:01.380 --> 00:58:02.580
<b>They're all government personnel.</b>

1149
00:58:02.710 --> 00:58:04.000
<b>Seems like they can't help us either.</b>

1150
00:58:05.000 --> 00:58:07.080
<b>After all this chaos. aren't you hungry?</b>

1151
00:58:07.500 --> 00:58:08.540
<b>Make yourself at home.</b>

1152
00:58:08.630 --> 00:58:10.290
<b>Let's eat whatever we have.</b>

1153
00:58:10.290 --> 00:58:11.960
<b>I didn't even realize I was hungry until you mentioned it!</b>

1154
00:59:02.420 --> 00:59:04.170
<font size="57"><b>Mr. Fok. everyone has left already.</b></font>

1155
00:59:04.170 --> 00:59:04.790
<b>Come.</b>

1156
00:59:04.790 --> 00:59:06.080
<b>Let's have a drink during Happy Hour.</b>

1157
00:59:06.750 --> 00:59:08.620
<b>We found new clues in the Ma Ka-kit case.</b>

1158
00:59:11.000 --> 00:59:12.790
<b>You know there's no allowance for working overtime?</b>

1159
00:59:15.880 --> 00:59:17.870
<b>Ma Ka-kit's previous boss. Lau Siu-keung.</b>

1160
00:59:18.080 --> 00:59:19.580
<b>provides a new lead in this case.</b>

1161
00:59:19.580 --> 00:59:22.750
<font size="57"><b>We need to find out about his relationship with Lee Sze-man and Au Pak-man.</b></font>

1162
00:59:22.790 --> 00:59:24.460
<b>That's the only way we can help Ma Ka-kit.</b>

1163
00:59:24.830 --> 00:59:26.210
<b>According to our intelligence reports.</b>

1164
00:59:26.290 --> 00:59:28.540
<b>Lau Siu-keung has opened many restaurants.</b>

1165
00:59:28.540 --> 00:59:29.870
<b>wine bars and nightclubs in recent years.</b>

1166
00:59:30.630 --> 00:59:32.330
<b>He appears to be a legitimate businessman.</b>

1167
00:59:32.460 --> 00:59:34.330
<font size="57"><b>but in reality. he collaborates with many triad leaders.</b></font>

1168
00:59:35.380 --> 00:59:38.540
<b>All his businesses are managed by Au Pak-man's law firm.</b>

1169
00:59:39.210 --> 00:59:41.370
<b>That Lee Sze-man is really something</b>

1170
00:59:41.670 --> 00:59:42.750
<b>She grew up in an orphanage.</b>

1171
00:59:42.960 --> 00:59:44.920
<b>and later Au Pak-Man paid for her education in the United States.</b>

1172
00:59:45.420 --> 00:59:47.290
<b>where she also obtained a law license.</b>

1173
00:59:48.170 --> 00:59:49.960
<font size="57"><b>I'd fall head over heels for him too if I were her.</b></font>

1174
00:59:50.250 --> 00:59:51.960
<b>I checked the records of the Department of Justice.</b>

1175
00:59:52.130 --> 00:59:53.710
<b>Au Pak-man got his early release</b>

1176
00:59:53.880 --> 00:59:55.500
<b>because Lee Sze-man helped him win the appeal.</b>

1177
01:00:05.630 --> 01:00:06.750
<b>What are you trying to say. Bao Ding?</b>

1178
01:00:08.080 --> 01:00:09.040
<b>Isn't it obvious enough?</b>

1179
01:00:09.670 --> 01:00:11.370
<b>They're a couple of crooks!</b>

1180
01:00:12.040 --> 01:00:13.670
<font size="57"><b>This Au Pak-man is impressive.</b></font>

1181
01:00:13.790 --> 01:00:14.830
<b>He's been in prison several times.</b>

1182
01:00:15.250 --> 01:00:16.750
<b>for assault. extortion. using fake documents. 
And escaping from prison.</b>

1183
01:00:16.750 --> 01:00:18.460
<b>He's committed so many crimes</b>

1184
01:00:18.500 --> 01:00:19.710
<b>and yet he can still talk to people about the law.</b>

1185
01:00:19.750 --> 01:00:20.830
<b>It's crazy.</b>

1186
01:00:21.170 --> 01:00:22.080
<b>I can handle it.</b>

1187
01:00:22.210 --> 01:00:23.710
<font size="57"><b>Dealing with the semen evidence is relatively easy.</b></font>

1188
01:00:23.880 --> 01:00:25.920
<b>because he wasn't caught in the act.</b>

1189
01:00:26.000 --> 01:00:27.000
<b>Au Pak Man. Yes.</b>

1190
01:00:27.380 --> 01:00:28.620
<b>Get lost! You get out!</b>

1191
01:00:28.630 --> 01:00:30.790
<b>Money laundering. right? I take a 20% cut.</b>

1192
01:00:30.830 --> 01:00:32.750
<b>Whether it's one billion or ten billion. I don't care.</b>

1193
01:00:32.750 --> 01:00:35.290
<b>In any case. I take a 20% commission.</b>

1194
01:00:35.630 --> 01:00:36.540
<font size="57"><b>The prison authorities say</b></font>

1195
01:00:36.580 --> 01:00:38.710
<b>he diligently studied law in prison.</b>

1196
01:00:38.920 --> 01:00:41.250
<b>After being released. he continued to commit crimes.</b>

1197
01:00:41.540 --> 01:00:44.080
<b>but every time. he managed to win his cases by himself.</b>

1198
01:00:44.170 --> 01:00:46.460
<b>He also got to know many influential figures in prison.</b>

1199
01:00:46.790 --> 01:00:48.290
<b>Including one that you personally arrested.</b>

1200
01:00:48.880 --> 01:00:50.370
<font size="57"><b>Sang. from Cambodia.</b></font>

1201
01:00:58.500 --> 01:01:00.170
<b>FIJI</b>

1202
01:01:08.500 --> 01:01:09.080
<b>Cash out.</b>

1203
01:01:09.630 --> 01:01:10.210
<b>Go</b>

1204
01:01:27.080 --> 01:01:29.420
<b>Ah Keung! It's true what the astrologers say about having a bad year.</b>

1205
01:01:29.420 --> 01:01:31.330
<b>Several of our food trucks got busted</b>

1206
01:01:31.670 --> 01:01:33.080
<b>Now we're also out of the stuff we put in coconuts.</b>

1207
01:01:33.500 --> 01:01:35.250
<b>So. I think we should lay low for a while.</b>

1208
01:01:35.250 --> 01:01:36.330
<font size="57"><b>Hold off on making deliveries for now.</b></font>

1209
01:01:36.830 --> 01:01:37.790
<b>No deliveries?</b>

1210
01:01:38.040 --> 01:01:39.620
<b>The boss will definitely throw a fit.</b>

1211
01:01:39.830 --> 01:01:40.790
<b>Throw a fit?</b>

1212
01:01:40.960 --> 01:01:42.460
<b>Let him throw a fit. then!</b>

1213
01:01:43.080 --> 01:01:45.250
<b>If we get stopped and searched by the police.</b>

1214
01:01:45.420 --> 01:01:46.710
<b>I'm as good as dead.</b>

1215
01:01:48.670 --> 01:01:50.790
<font size="57"><b>That incident with Uncle Ma. It was done by one of them. wasn't it?</b></font>

1216
01:01:51.210 --> 01:01:52.580
<b>You're really something.</b>

1217
01:01:52.670 --> 01:01:54.170
<b>You're right. Nothing escapes you.</b>

1218
01:01:54.920 --> 01:01:57.250
<b>It could be either Tung or Sang.</b>

1219
01:01:57.670 --> 01:01:58.750
<b>Who else can it be?</b>

1220
01:01:59.500 --> 01:02:00.710
<b>That's why I always say.</b>

1221
01:02:00.830 --> 01:02:02.290
<b>fools will be fools.</b>

1222
01:02:02.290 --> 01:02:03.540
<font size="57"><b>They dont use their brains when they act.</b></font>

1223
01:02:03.630 --> 01:02:04.370
<b>Keung.</b>

1224
01:02:06.290 --> 01:02:07.460
<b>you're a smart guy.</b>

1225
01:02:07.920 --> 01:02:09.290
<b>you're a civilised person.</b>

1226
01:02:10.040 --> 01:02:11.370
<b>So. in the future. whatever you do.</b>

1227
01:02:11.500 --> 01:02:13.870
<b>don't be as foolish as they are.</b>

1228
01:02:14.500 --> 01:02:15.170
<b>Okay?</b>

1229
01:02:15.460 --> 01:02:16.120
<b>Understood. boss.</b>

1230
01:02:28.170 --> 01:02:28.870
<b>Sang. please have a seat.</b>

1231
01:02:28.880 --> 01:02:29.710
<font size="57"><b>Sang!</b></font>

1232
01:02:39.380 --> 01:02:40.420
<b>Your underlings</b>

1233
01:02:40.750 --> 01:02:42.920
<b>stole the shipment of coconuts from me.</b>

1234
01:02:43.170 --> 01:02:45.370
<b>causing me to lose 50 million.</b>

1235
01:02:46.170 --> 01:02:47.460
<b>When are you going to compensate me?</b>

1236
01:02:47.460 --> 01:02:50.210
<b>You can only accuse him of stealing if he's taken it for himself.</b>

1237
01:02:50.540 --> 01:02:51.920
<b>It was the police that confiscated everything.</b>

1238
01:02:52.210 --> 01:02:53.540
<font size="57"><b>I want to give you the goods as compensation.</b></font>

1239
01:02:53.630 --> 01:02:55.250
<b>Man can't make any deliveries.</b>

1240
01:02:55.540 --> 01:02:56.790
<b>Listen to what he has to say.</b>

1241
01:02:58.170 --> 01:02:59.330
<b>Personally. I think</b>

1242
01:02:59.790 --> 01:03:02.080
<b>if we make deliveries now. it's like handing them over to the police.</b>

1243
01:03:02.380 --> 01:03:03.790
<b>You won't necessarily lose 50 million.</b>

1244
01:03:04.040 --> 01:03:05.250
<b>I'll personally make it up to you.</b>

1245
01:03:06.460 --> 01:03:07.540
<font size="57"><b>As for Tung.</b></font>

1246
01:03:07.630 --> 01:03:09.870
<b>I'll give you a 30% discount on the next three shipments.</b>

1247
01:03:10.000 --> 01:03:10.830
<b>Everyone will be happy.</b>

1248
01:03:10.830 --> 01:03:12.210
<b>Such a wonderful deal.</b>

1249
01:03:16.420 --> 01:03:17.870
<b>You think money solves everything?</b>

1250
01:03:18.960 --> 01:03:19.790
<b>Sang.</b>

1251
01:03:20.330 --> 01:03:21.790
<b>I know what you want.</b>

1252
01:03:33.830 --> 01:03:35.830
<b>Tung! You're not going to do this. are you?</b>

1253
01:03:35.830 --> 01:03:37.040
<font size="57"><b>I've followed you since I was a kid!</b></font>

1254
01:03:37.040 --> 01:03:38.210
<b>You're really going to do this to me?</b>

1255
01:03:40.290 --> 01:03:42.000
<b>Let go of me! Don't do this.</b>

1256
01:03:42.130 --> 01:03:44.040
<b>This time. my underling made a mistake.</b>

1257
01:03:44.130 --> 01:03:45.250
<b>I know what to do.</b>

1258
01:03:46.040 --> 01:03:46.750
<b>Man!</b>

1259
01:03:47.880 --> 01:03:48.830
<b>Lend me a hand.</b>

1260
01:03:51.380 --> 01:03:52.170
<b>What's the matter?</b>

1261
01:03:52.790 --> 01:03:54.460
<font size="57"><b>Do what the boss asked you to. shithead.</b></font>

1262
01:03:54.460 --> 01:03:55.870
<b>Hit him!</b>

1263
01:03:55.880 --> 01:03:57.120
<b>I told you to hit him!</b>

1264
01:03:58.330 --> 01:03:59.290
<b>Come on!</b>

1265
01:04:04.460 --> 01:04:05.370
<b>Sang!</b>

1266
01:04:05.380 --> 01:04:07.370
<b>I didn't know the cocaine in those coconuts belonged to you</b>

1267
01:04:07.460 --> 01:04:08.580
<b>Give me another chance!</b>

1268
01:04:09.170 --> 01:04:11.080
<b>Tung! I know where I messed up!</b>

1269
01:04:11.170 --> 01:04:13.460
<font size="57"><b>Please ask Sang to give me another chance!</b></font>

1270
01:04:14.080 --> 01:04:14.960
<b>Boss Tung!</b>

1271
01:04:15.710 --> 01:04:16.460
<b>Don't do this!</b>

1272
01:04:30.250 --> 01:04:32.080
<b>Wow! Did you need to be so brutal?</b>

1273
01:04:32.330 --> 01:04:33.290
<b>Are you satisfied?</b>

1274
01:04:37.920 --> 01:04:39.580
<b>Well. I didn't say he shouldn't be.</b>

1275
01:04:39.880 --> 01:04:41.000
<b>Take him to a doctor.</b>

1276
01:04:45.880 --> 01:04:48.750
<b>Remember to make the delivery for us tomorrow.</b>

1277
01:04:49.130 --> 01:04:50.120
<font size="57"><b>Gentlemen.</b></font>

1278
01:04:51.000 --> 01:04:52.580
<b>I really want to make the delivery.</b>

1279
01:04:52.580 --> 01:04:54.370
<b>but my case hasn't been resolved yet.</b>

1280
01:04:54.540 --> 01:04:55.580
<b>I'm being watched closely.</b>

1281
01:04:57.880 --> 01:05:00.080
<b>I'll take care of your case.</b>

1282
01:05:00.710 --> 01:05:03.250
<b>Remember to continue making the deliveries.</b>

1283
01:05:04.630 --> 01:05:05.830
<b>yogi hear me?</b>

1284
01:05:07.540 --> 01:05:08.210
<b>Let's go.</b>

1285
01:05:13.210 --> 01:05:14.420
<font size="57"><b>I'll take my leave. Sang.</b></font>

1286
01:05:16.420 --> 01:05:16.960
<b>You bastard.</b>

1287
01:05:16.960 --> 01:05:19.750
<b>You're so brutal even with your own underlings.</b>

1288
01:05:19.750 --> 01:05:21.080
<b>He's got to do what he's got to do!</b>

1289
01:05:22.920 --> 01:05:24.120
<b>You won't scare him into delivering the goods properly</b>

1290
01:05:25.380 --> 01:05:27.000
<b>if you don't show them something.</b>

1291
01:05:41.250 --> 01:05:42.250
<b>Hello. Bao Ding.</b>

1292
01:05:42.880 --> 01:05:43.790
<b>I can't hear you!</b>

1293
01:05:45.580 --> 01:05:47.330
<font size="57"><b>It's so noisy there. Speak louder!</b></font>

1294
01:06:21.960 --> 01:06:23.040
<b>You piece of shit!</b>

1295
01:06:23.210 --> 01:06:24.830
<b>This is my place. and you're doing drugs here?</b>

1296
01:06:24.920 --> 01:06:26.790
<b>You dare to disrespect me?</b>

1297
01:06:26.790 --> 01:06:28.330
<b>Without me. you'd have been dead a long time ago!</b>

1298
01:06:28.380 --> 01:06:29.370
<b>Get the fuck out!</b>

1299
01:06:29.750 --> 01:06:31.540
<b>Now get going!</b>

1300
01:06:35.880 --> 01:06:37.420
<font size="57"><b>You bastard! Are you pretending to be a big shot?</b></font>

1301
01:06:39.290 --> 01:06:40.120
<b>I'm not your big brother. am I?</b>

1302
01:06:40.130 --> 01:06:41.420
<b>My last name is Chan.</b>

1303
01:06:41.790 --> 01:06:42.670
<b>Your dad is not my dad.</b>

1304
01:06:42.670 --> 01:06:44.500
<b>Isn't your mom my mom?</b>

1305
01:06:44.630 --> 01:06:45.330
<b>So what if she is?</b>

1306
01:06:45.330 --> 01:06:45.870
<b>Get lost!</b>

1307
01:06:47.380 --> 01:06:48.370
<b>I'll leave when I'm finished.</b>

1308
01:06:51.670 --> 01:06:52.540
<b>Bitch!</b>

1309
01:06:53.000 --> 01:06:54.620
<font size="57"><b>Stop! Someone is filming us.</b></font>

1310
01:06:56.790 --> 01:06:58.250
<b>I've seen him in court.</b>

1311
01:07:03.880 --> 01:07:04.580
<b>Sorry.</b>

1312
01:07:13.080 --> 01:07:14.040
<b>What were you filming?</b>

1313
01:07:17.920 --> 01:07:19.460
<b>Give me your phone.</b>

1314
01:07:23.920 --> 01:07:24.830
<b>Hey! Beating someone up?</b>

1315
01:07:24.830 --> 01:07:25.670
<b>Getting into a gang fight?</b>

1316
01:07:26.960 --> 01:07:28.080
<b>I've already called the police.</b>

1317
01:07:32.380 --> 01:07:33.500
<b>Why were you so slow getting here?</b>

1318
01:07:33.500 --> 01:07:34.330
<font size="57"><b>Let's go.</b></font>

1319
01:07:34.750 --> 01:07:36.000
<b>I've got what we need. Let's leave quickly.</b>

1320
01:07:36.460 --> 01:07:37.170
<b>Are you OK?</b>

1321
01:07:37.710 --> 01:07:38.870
<b>Let's find Ah Wai.</b>

1322
01:07:40.710 --> 01:07:42.040
<b>He's on his way.</b>

1323
01:07:42.580 --> 01:07:43.710
<b>You called the police?</b>

1324
01:07:43.920 --> 01:07:45.710
<b>We'll beat up even the police.</b>

1325
01:07:47.080 --> 01:07:47.920
<b>Have you ever fought before?</b>

1326
01:07:48.040 --> 01:07:49.540
<b>Never! I was a model student.</b>

1327
01:08:39.920 --> 01:08:40.370
<font size="57"><b>Hello?</b></font>

1328
01:08:40.380 --> 01:08:40.960
<b>Ah Wai?</b>

1329
01:08:40.960 --> 01:08:41.870
<b>Why aren't you here yet?</b>

1330
01:08:42.040 --> 01:08:42.960
<b>Your friend</b>

1331
01:08:42.960 --> 01:08:44.170
<b>is beating up a hundred people!</b>

1332
01:08:44.290 --> 01:08:45.080
<b>No!</b>

1333
01:08:45.170 --> 01:08:46.370
<b>I mean he's being beaten up by a hundred people!</b>

1334
01:10:59.420 --> 01:11:00.290
<b>Don't hit me!</b>

1335
01:11:00.420 --> 01:11:01.210
<b>Mr. Fok?</b>

1336
01:11:01.330 --> 01:11:02.920
<b>Mr. Fok! It's me.</b>

1337
01:11:03.080 --> 01:11:03.870
<font size="57"><b>It's me!</b></font>

1338
01:11:05.710 --> 01:11:07.370
<b>You're lucky to be alive!</b>

1339
01:11:09.130 --> 01:11:09.710
<b>I'll take you to dinner.</b>

1340
01:11:09.710 --> 01:11:10.750
<b>That Lau Siu-keung.</b>

1341
01:11:11.130 --> 01:11:13.580
<b>turns out he is Chan Kwok-Wing's half-brother.</b>

1342
01:11:13.960 --> 01:11:15.040
<b>I recorded everything.</b>

1343
01:11:15.420 --> 01:11:17.420
<b>This place belongs to Lau Siu-keung.</b>

1344
01:11:17.790 --> 01:11:19.500
<b>The guys in suits who attacked you earlier</b>

1345
01:11:19.500 --> 01:11:20.460
<font size="57"><b>are the security guards here.</b></font>

1346
01:11:20.580 --> 01:11:22.620
<b>Every one of them insisted on hiring a lawyer</b>

1347
01:11:22.880 --> 01:11:25.250
<b>and specifically asked for Au Pak-man's law firm.</b>

1348
01:11:25.250 --> 01:11:28.080
<b>Justice will prevail. Heaven is on our side.</b>

1349
01:11:28.500 --> 01:11:30.580
<b>The two brothers are obstructing justice.</b>

1350
01:11:30.750 --> 01:11:32.330
<b>The case of Ma Ka Kit can move forward now.</b>

1351
01:11:37.130 --> 01:11:37.790
<b>Mr. Yeung.</b>

1352
01:11:38.750 --> 01:11:39.670
<font size="57"><b>Hey. Mr. Bao.</b></font>

1353
01:11:39.710 --> 01:11:40.620
<b>I need to talk to you about something.</b>

1354
01:11:41.250 --> 01:11:42.960
<b>I'm rushing to the High Court.</b>

1355
01:11:42.960 --> 01:11:44.920
<b>What's the matter? It's urgent. I need to tell you now.</b>

1356
01:11:48.330 --> 01:11:48.830
<b>How do you know Lee Sze-man?</b>

1357
01:11:48.830 --> 01:11:49.870
<b>How do you know Lee Sze-man?</b>

1358
01:11:50.040 --> 01:11:52.500
<b>Through the boss of the restaurant where Kit works.</b>

1359
01:11:52.750 --> 01:11:54.370
<font size="57"><b>I think his last name is 'Lau'.</b></font>

1360
01:11:54.750 --> 01:11:55.420
<b>Uncle Ma said</b>

1361
01:11:55.420 --> 01:11:57.670
<b>that Lau Siu-keung introduced Au Pak-man to him</b>

1362
01:11:58.000 --> 01:11:59.750
<b>and this Lau Siu-keung and Chan Kwok-wing.</b>

1363
01:11:59.750 --> 01:12:01.170
<b>it turns out they're half-brothers.</b>

1364
01:12:01.170 --> 01:12:03.460
<b>They've been colluding for a long time. obstructing justice.</b>

1365
01:12:04.290 --> 01:12:05.790
<b>Bao. you're so enthusiastic.</b>

1366
01:12:05.830 --> 01:12:06.960
<font size="57"><b>Go join their investigation team.</b></font>

1367
01:12:06.960 --> 01:12:07.370
<b>Go join their investigation team.</b>

1368
01:12:16.380 --> 01:12:19.790
<b>Uncle Ma is going to file an official report now and give a statement.</b>

1369
01:12:19.790 --> 01:12:21.750
<b>You should go and take a look. There's new evidence.</b>

1370
01:12:22.080 --> 01:12:23.830
<b>Now the Legal Aid Department</b>

1371
01:12:23.880 --> 01:12:26.960
<b>is citing 'Judge's Misguidance of the Jury'.</b>

1372
01:12:26.960 --> 01:12:28.370
<font size="57"><b>They're sending it back for retrial.</b></font>

1373
01:12:28.380 --> 01:12:30.420
<b>It will begin in 28 days.</b>

1374
01:12:30.580 --> 01:12:31.750
<b>I really don't understand.</b>

1375
01:12:31.750 --> 01:12:33.170
<b>Why do they keep trying</b>

1376
01:12:33.170 --> 01:12:34.920
<b>such a minor case?</b>

1377
01:12:35.170 --> 01:12:36.670
<b>I don't want people to think that</b>

1378
01:12:36.670 --> 01:12:39.250
<b>the DOJ is unprofessional.</b>

1379
01:12:39.420 --> 01:12:41.420
<b>After the police finish recording the statements.</b>

1380
01:12:41.420 --> 01:12:43.500
<font size="57"><b>they will submit them to the DOJ.</b></font>

1381
01:12:43.710 --> 01:12:45.960
<b>The DOJ will then consider whether to accept them or not.</b>

1382
01:12:46.250 --> 01:12:47.540
<b>Of course. I know that.</b>

1383
01:12:47.830 --> 01:12:50.080
<b>but I don't want our own people to suspect each other.</b>

1384
01:12:50.540 --> 01:12:52.250
<b>What do you want to say? Spit it out!</b>

1385
01:12:52.500 --> 01:12:55.290
<b>The DOJ has prosecuted Au Pak-man three times.</b>

1386
01:12:55.540 --> 01:12:57.080
<font size="57"><b>and all three times. Au Pak-man was set free.</b></font>

1387
01:12:57.290 --> 01:12:59.620
<b>The same prosecutor handled all three cases.</b>

1388
01:12:59.630 --> 01:13:00.710
<b>Yeung Ti-lap</b>

1389
01:13:00.750 --> 01:13:02.460
<b>You were the lead prosecutor in all three cases.</b>

1390
01:13:03.540 --> 01:13:04.790
<b>How long have you known me. Bao Ding?</b>

1391
01:13:04.790 --> 01:13:05.420
<b>36 years.</b>

1392
01:13:05.420 --> 01:13:08.040
<b>Do you know that I handle over a thousand cases every year?</b>

1393
01:13:08.210 --> 01:13:09.170
<font size="57"><b>Three cases.</b></font>

1394
01:13:09.170 --> 01:13:11.000
<b>What are you trying to tell me about these three cases?</b>

1395
01:13:11.000 --> 01:13:13.210
<b>Mr Yeung. Are you trying to come after me?</b>

1396
01:13:13.920 --> 01:13:16.170
<b>Just this afternoon. I have 38 cases</b>

1397
01:13:16.250 --> 01:13:17.580
<b>waiting for me to handle.</b>

1398
01:13:17.580 --> 01:13:19.500
<b>If you have evidence to support your accusation.</b>

1399
01:13:19.580 --> 01:13:21.710
<b>then please report me immediately.</b>

1400
01:13:21.710 --> 01:13:24.290
<font size="57"><b>Otherwise don't waste my time with this nonsense!</b></font>

1401
01:13:37.880 --> 01:13:38.830
<b>I want to hire a lawyer.</b>

1402
01:13:38.880 --> 01:13:40.620
<b>No matter how many retrials there are in this case.</b>

1403
01:13:40.710 --> 01:13:42.370
<b>the result will be the same. We won't lose.</b>

1404
01:13:42.420 --> 01:13:44.290
<b>I don't care about winning or losing.</b>

1405
01:13:44.630 --> 01:13:46.580
<b>I care about giving the public confidence.</b>

1406
01:13:46.580 --> 01:13:49.420
<font size="57"><b>Knowing that we have the ability to uphold the rule of law.</b></font>

1407
01:13:49.500 --> 01:13:52.000
<b>Legal Aid has arranged for you to give a statement at the police station.</b>

1408
01:13:52.000 --> 01:13:53.750
<b>As long as you reveal Lau Siu-keung</b>

1409
01:13:53.750 --> 01:13:55.870
<b>introduced the lawyer to you.</b>

1410
01:13:55.880 --> 01:13:57.080
<b>they will be obstructing justice.</b>

1411
01:13:57.080 --> 01:13:57.460
<b>they will be obstructing justice.</b>

1412
01:13:57.460 --> 01:13:58.670
<font size="57"><b>and there will be hope for Kit.</b></font>

1413
01:14:00.170 --> 01:14:02.040
<b>It seems Kit really has a chance.</b>

1414
01:14:02.540 --> 01:14:03.210
<b>Thank you</b>

1415
01:14:03.290 --> 01:14:04.750
<b>Don't mention it. It's my duty.</b>

1416
01:14:05.920 --> 01:14:07.620
<b>But you will have to testify in court.</b>

1417
01:14:07.830 --> 01:14:08.500
<b>Hang in there.</b>

1418
01:14:08.630 --> 01:14:09.870
<b>I'm hanging in there!</b>

1419
01:14:10.500 --> 01:14:12.460
<b>I hope that after Kit comes out.</b>

1420
01:14:12.460 --> 01:14:14.290
<font size="57"><b>he can be sensible and go back to studying.</b></font>

1421
01:14:14.460 --> 01:14:16.330
<b>In the future. perhaps he can become a great lawyer like you.</b>

1422
01:14:16.540 --> 01:14:17.710
<b>You're too kind.</b>

1423
01:14:18.250 --> 01:14:19.830
<b>I see that your grandson</b>

1424
01:14:19.920 --> 01:14:21.170
<b>has great artistic talent.</b>

1425
01:14:21.170 --> 01:14:22.460
<b>I know. He paints very well.</b>

1426
01:14:23.210 --> 01:14:25.370
<b>Paintings nowadays sell for very high prices.</b>

1427
01:14:25.880 --> 01:14:26.870
<font size="57"><b>Actually.</b></font>

1428
01:14:27.250 --> 01:14:29.120
<b>it doesn't matter what field he studies.</b>

1429
01:14:29.130 --> 01:14:31.460
<b>The most important thing is to find a nice girlfriend.</b>

1430
01:14:31.540 --> 01:14:33.210
<b>If I can see him get married and have children.</b>

1431
01:14:33.210 --> 01:14:34.620
<b>then I'll be satisfied.</b>

1432
01:14:35.000 --> 01:14:36.330
<b>I'm looking forward to that wedding banquet!</b>

1433
01:14:36.330 --> 01:14:37.580
<b>I'll reserve a seat for you!</b>

1434
01:14:38.670 --> 01:14:39.580
<font size="57"><b>I'm going to the restroom.</b></font>

1435
01:14:40.500 --> 01:14:41.790
<b>On the wedding day. you can sit at the host's table.</b>

1436
01:14:41.790 --> 01:14:43.330
<b>It doesn't matter. Just so long as I get to eat!</b>

1437
01:15:48.960 --> 01:15:51.290
<b>Prosecutor Fok. I beg you.</b>

1438
01:15:51.830 --> 01:15:53.460
<b>You're from the Department of Justice.</b>

1439
01:15:53.670 --> 01:15:55.420
<b>Can you talk to the judge</b>

1440
01:15:55.460 --> 01:15:57.960
<b>and let me out for just one day? Just one day.</b>

1441
01:15:58.670 --> 01:16:00.540
<font size="57"><b>After that. I can spend my whole life in prison.</b></font>

1442
01:16:02.880 --> 01:16:04.330
<b>I want revenge!</b>

1443
01:16:13.250 --> 01:16:14.460
<b>I don't understand.</b>

1444
01:16:15.710 --> 01:16:16.870
<b>I really...</b>

1445
01:16:17.290 --> 01:16:20.040
<b>I really don't understand why none of you are willing to help me?</b>

1446
01:16:20.830 --> 01:16:22.960
<b>I really didn't do anything!</b>

1447
01:16:23.670 --> 01:16:25.250
<b>I rented out my address</b>

1448
01:16:25.250 --> 01:16:28.500
<font size="57"><b>just to make a few bucks to help my grandfather with household expenses.</b></font>

1449
01:16:29.130 --> 01:16:31.620
<b>I simply wished that we could have better meals.</b>

1450
01:16:32.040 --> 01:16:33.870
<b>eat together at a nice table.</b>

1451
01:16:33.880 --> 01:16:36.920
<b>and have a house that doesn't leak. It's as simple as that.</b>

1452
01:16:37.580 --> 01:16:39.420
<b>Did I really do something wrong?</b>

1453
01:16:52.880 --> 01:16:54.330
<font size="57"><b>A relative of Ma Ka-kit was recently found dead with multiple stab wounds.</b></font>

1454
01:16:54.330 --> 01:16:56.210
<b>Could someone be trying to silence them?</b>

1455
01:16:56.920 --> 01:16:58.830
<b>Did the Department of Justice accuse the wrong person?</b>

1456
01:16:58.830 --> 01:17:00.420
<b>Everyone is paying close attention to this case.</b>

1457
01:17:00.420 --> 01:17:02.080
<b>I want to ask. what mindset will you approach this with?</b>

1458
01:17:02.540 --> 01:17:05.040
<font size="57"><b>This case has entered the judicial process.</b></font>

1459
01:17:05.040 --> 01:17:07.170
<b>I'm not in a position to make any comments. Sorry.</b>

1460
01:17:07.170 --> 01:17:10.040
<b>If the appeal is successful. would it damage the reputation of the DOJ?</b>

1461
01:17:10.130 --> 01:17:13.710
<b>The Department of Justice's reputation is irrelevant.</b>

1462
01:17:13.920 --> 01:17:15.960
<b>The work of the Department of Justice is based on evidence.</b>

1463
01:17:16.290 --> 01:17:18.250
<b>We present the evidence to the court.</b>

1464
01:17:18.580 --> 01:17:20.580
<font size="57"><b>The court makes the final decision.</b></font>

1465
01:17:37.580 --> 01:17:39.080
<b>We've checked this matter many times.</b>

1466
01:17:39.670 --> 01:17:40.670
<b>No leads.</b>

1467
01:17:41.290 --> 01:17:43.790
<b>No witnesses. no fingerprints. no murder weapon.</b>

1468
01:17:44.670 --> 01:17:45.960
<b>Have the surveillance cameras</b>

1469
01:17:45.960 --> 01:17:49.080
<b>in the shops across the street been checked?</b>

1470
01:17:50.330 --> 01:17:52.460
<b>Have you searched for the cars</b>

1471
01:17:52.460 --> 01:17:53.670
<font size="57"><b>and pedestrians that passed by?</b></font>

1472
01:17:58.460 --> 01:18:01.290
<b>If you can't find anything it means you're just not good enough!</b>

1473
01:18:05.500 --> 01:18:08.500
<b>My colleagues and I haven't stopped working for 48 hours!</b>

1474
01:18:08.920 --> 01:18:10.420
<b>It's not that we don't want to find anything.</b>

1475
01:18:10.710 --> 01:18:12.170
<b>No evidence. no witnesses.</b>

1476
01:18:12.330 --> 01:18:13.620
<b>I can't think of another way.</b>

1477
01:18:13.670 --> 01:18:15.420
<font size="57"><b>If there's no way. we have to find a way.</b></font>

1478
01:18:15.750 --> 01:18:16.920
<b>I have confidence in you.</b>

1479
01:18:17.380 --> 01:18:19.620
<b>but you need to have confidence in yourself.</b>

1480
01:18:20.210 --> 01:18:22.080
<b>Do you remember what we used to say?</b>

1481
01:18:23.920 --> 01:18:25.040
<b>Stay strong and keep true?</b>

1482
01:18:25.040 --> 01:18:25.960
<b>Stay strong and keep true?</b>

1483
01:18:26.040 --> 01:18:28.080
<b>Everyone here is staying strong and keeping true!</b>

1484
01:18:30.330 --> 01:18:32.210
<font size="57"><b>But we can't eliminate crimes!</b></font>

1485
01:18:34.670 --> 01:18:36.420
<b>Even we police are helpless sometimes.</b>

1486
01:18:37.420 --> 01:18:39.040
<b>No matter what. you can find a way!</b>

1487
01:18:40.000 --> 01:18:41.080
<b>Now I understand</b>

1488
01:18:41.580 --> 01:18:43.040
<b>why you gave up back then.</b>

1489
01:18:57.460 --> 01:18:58.290
<b>Mr. Fok.</b>

1490
01:18:59.830 --> 01:19:01.870
<b>Hi. long time. no see!</b>

1491
01:19:02.670 --> 01:19:03.710
<b>Is this your son?</b>

1492
01:19:04.330 --> 01:19:04.920
<b>Yes.</b>

1493
01:19:05.210 --> 01:19:05.960
<font size="57"><b>His name is Luk Luk. Hello.</b></font>

1494
01:19:05.960 --> 01:19:06.790
<b>Hello. Uncle.</b>

1495
01:19:06.790 --> 01:19:08.040
<b>Hello. Luk Luk.</b>

1496
01:19:09.670 --> 01:19:10.420
<b>Thank you.</b>

1497
01:19:11.630 --> 01:19:12.710
<b>Are you still in the Rapid Action Unit?</b>

1498
01:19:13.040 --> 01:19:13.790
<b>Yes.</b>

1499
01:19:14.040 --> 01:19:15.170
<b>I just finished my board interview.</b>

1500
01:19:15.250 --> 01:19:16.500
<b>There's a chance for a promotion to Inspector.</b>

1501
01:19:16.500 --> 01:19:17.750
<b>That's great! Keep it up.</b>

1502
01:19:18.040 --> 01:19:20.330
<font size="57"><b>Stay strong and keep true!</b></font>

1503
01:19:21.170 --> 01:19:22.170
<b>Office Fok.</b>

1504
01:19:22.460 --> 01:19:24.080
<b>during that operation seven years ago.</b>

1505
01:19:24.080 --> 01:19:25.830
<b>I was already three months pregnant with him.</b>

1506
01:19:26.460 --> 01:19:28.120
<b>If it weren't for you saving me.</b>

1507
01:19:28.420 --> 01:19:29.830
<b>he wouldn't be sitting here.</b>

1508
01:19:30.500 --> 01:19:31.420
<b>Thank you.</b>

1509
01:19:33.580 --> 01:19:35.040
<b>I never gave up.</b>

1510
01:19:35.880 --> 01:19:37.540
<font size="57"><b>I just got old.</b></font>

1511
01:19:37.750 --> 01:19:39.540
<b>I can't charge ahead all the time.</b>

1512
01:19:39.630 --> 01:19:40.960
<b>Being in the front line</b>

1513
01:19:41.040 --> 01:19:42.710
<b>really depends on all of you.</b>

1514
01:19:45.460 --> 01:19:46.580
<b>That's why</b>

1515
01:19:47.250 --> 01:19:49.290
<b>I transferred to the Department of Justice.</b>

1516
01:19:51.380 --> 01:19:53.080
<b>I want to guard the final door.</b>

1517
01:20:05.790 --> 01:20:07.210
<b>As long as you have faith.</b>

1518
01:20:09.000 --> 01:20:10.000
<font size="57"><b>you can do it!</b></font>

1519
01:20:12.330 --> 01:20:13.750
<b>Stay true to your goals.</b>

1520
01:20:15.130 --> 01:20:17.420
<b>It would be great if everyone had your enthusiasm!</b>

1521
01:20:17.500 --> 01:20:18.580
<b>You have it.</b>

1522
01:20:20.580 --> 01:20:21.250
<b>Copy that.</b>

1523
01:20:28.460 --> 01:20:30.120
<b>Alright. Let's keep going!</b>

1524
01:20:32.710 --> 01:20:33.790
<b>Don't stop. everyone!</b>

1525
01:20:34.460 --> 01:20:35.170
<b>Never give up!</b>

1526
01:20:35.330 --> 01:20:36.040
<b>Copy!</b>

1527
01:20:36.040 --> 01:20:36.920
<b>Keep going!</b>

1528
01:21:00.460 --> 01:21:01.250
<font size="57"><b>Bao Ding.</b></font>

1529
01:21:01.580 --> 01:21:03.080
<b>There is no overtime pay.</b>

1530
01:21:03.210 --> 01:21:04.710
<b>Just leave if you have no loyalty.</b>

1531
01:21:08.670 --> 01:21:09.330
<b>Hey.</b>

1532
01:21:10.790 --> 01:21:12.040
<b>there are still over a dozen cases.</b>

1533
01:21:12.040 --> 01:21:13.790
<b>We can't finish them all in two weeks!</b>

1534
01:21:17.630 --> 01:21:18.960
<b>You should have stayed being a police officer.</b>

1535
01:21:18.960 --> 01:21:20.920
<b>If I hadn't met you. I wouldn’t have to work so hard.</b>

1536
01:21:21.960 --> 01:21:24.000
<font size="57"><b>Coming to the Department of Justice for no reason</b></font>

1537
01:21:24.750 --> 01:21:26.330
<b>I don't even know why you're here!</b>

1538
01:21:28.170 --> 01:21:29.870
<b>Do you want to know why?</b>

1539
01:21:31.290 --> 01:21:33.500
<b>Tell me. stop being mysterious!</b>

1540
01:21:40.210 --> 01:21:43.210
<b>Because I think our work</b>

1541
01:21:43.460 --> 01:21:46.170
<b>is like an eternal brilliant light.</b>

1542
01:21:46.750 --> 01:21:47.750
<b>It shines the glory of fairness and justice</b>

1543
01:21:47.750 --> 01:21:49.500
<font size="57"><b>It shines the glory of fairness and justice</b></font>

1544
01:21:50.170 --> 01:21:52.710
<b>into the hearts of the people.</b>

1545
01:21:52.960 --> 01:21:55.330
<b>into every dark coY-ner.</b>

1546
01:21:59.080 --> 01:22:01.420
<b>I'm getting old. I can't catch thieves anymore.</b>

1547
01:22:01.500 --> 01:22:02.870
<b>My knees aren't working as well.</b>

1548
01:22:03.750 --> 01:22:06.290
<b>I'm still young. I can handle it.</b>

1549
01:22:14.540 --> 01:22:15.420
<b>You were right.</b>

1550
01:22:16.500 --> 01:22:17.750
<font size="57"><b>There really was a third person at the scene of that case.</b></font>

1551
01:22:17.750 --> 01:22:19.870
<b>It was a conspiracy to commit murder.</b>

1552
01:22:20.540 --> 01:22:21.670
<b>I'm willing to admit defeat.</b>

1553
01:22:31.580 --> 01:22:33.080
<b>I'm the most skilled at reviewing documents.</b>

1554
01:22:33.420 --> 01:22:34.670
<b>We'll all help you.</b>

1555
01:22:36.670 --> 01:22:38.420
<b>Enough said. Let's do this together.</b>

1556
01:22:39.080 --> 01:22:39.500
<b>Look at all this. Of course we'll help.</b>

1557
01:22:39.500 --> 01:22:41.040
<font size="57"><b>Look at all this. Of course we'll help.</b></font>

1558
01:22:42.500 --> 01:22:43.620
<b>I'll take care of this box.</b>

1559
01:22:44.920 --> 01:22:46.040
<b>I'll be responsible for this box.</b>

1560
01:22:51.500 --> 01:22:53.420
<b>That bright light!</b>

1561
01:22:55.290 --> 01:22:56.210
<b>I've extinguished it!</b>

1562
01:23:13.790 --> 01:23:15.290
<b>The criminal organization has a pattern.</b>

1563
01:23:15.290 --> 01:23:17.080
<b>There are more victims like Ma Ka-kit.</b>

1564
01:23:17.080 --> 01:23:18.420
<font size="57"><b>There are many Ma Ka-kits out there.</b></font>

1565
01:23:18.670 --> 01:23:21.170
<b>Before the trial. we need to find one more Ma Ka-kit</b>

1566
01:23:21.170 --> 01:23:22.750
<b>who is willing to testify.</b>

1567
01:23:23.040 --> 01:23:24.710
<b>But gangs mailing drugs into Hong Kong</b>

1568
01:23:24.710 --> 01:23:26.250
<b>happens at least 300 times a year.</b>

1569
01:23:26.330 --> 01:23:27.710
<b>totaling over 1.000 cases.</b>

1570
01:23:27.790 --> 01:23:29.370
<b>We only have a few days. I know it's difficult.</b>

1571
01:23:29.380 --> 01:23:30.790
<font size="57"><b>but I know it won't get the better of you!</b></font>

1572
01:23:49.290 --> 01:23:50.620
<b>There's a young man who's just like you.</b>

1573
01:23:50.630 --> 01:23:51.830
<b>Your testimony can help him.</b>

1574
01:23:51.830 --> 01:23:52.830
<b>I've already served my full sentence.</b>

1575
01:23:52.830 --> 01:23:54.000
<b>what do you want from me?</b>

1576
01:23:54.000 --> 01:23:54.750
<b>Just go!</b>

1577
01:23:59.380 --> 01:24:01.080
<b>My son just got out of the juvenile detention center!</b>

1578
01:24:01.080 --> 01:24:02.330
<font size="57"><b>I will call the police if you come again!</b></font>

1579
01:24:18.330 --> 01:24:20.250
<b>I don't mind going to the police station and giving a statement.</b>

1580
01:24:20.380 --> 01:24:21.710
<b>I'd rather not go to court. though.</b>

1581
01:24:21.960 --> 01:24:24.040
<b>I'm afraid to let other people know I've been to prison.</b>

1582
01:24:24.040 --> 01:24:26.330
<b>I understand. but there's a young man just like you.</b>

1583
01:24:26.330 --> 01:24:28.370
<b>He also received a package and was accused of drug trafficking.</b>

1584
01:24:31.330 --> 01:24:32.620
<font size="57"><b>Stop bothering me already!</b></font>

1585
01:24:39.790 --> 01:24:41.710
<b>Did this person introduce a lawyer to you?</b>

1586
01:24:41.920 --> 01:24:43.210
<b>This person has harmed many people</b>

1587
01:24:43.210 --> 01:24:44.330
<b>using the same method.</b>

1588
01:24:46.170 --> 01:24:47.080
<b>Please help.</b>

1589
01:24:47.380 --> 01:24:50.960
<b>A young man who received a package and was accused of drug trafficking.</b>

1590
01:24:52.130 --> 01:24:54.420
<b>If you testify in court. you can save him.</b>

1591
01:24:59.920 --> 01:25:00.460
<font size="57"><b>Hey!</b></font>

1592
01:25:01.130 --> 01:25:01.790
<b>Bingo!</b>

1593
01:25:02.080 --> 01:25:02.920
<b>Someone has agreed to appear in court!</b>

1594
01:25:03.080 --> 01:25:03.790
<b>That's great!</b>

1595
01:25:08.250 --> 01:25:08.870
<b>Thank you.</b>

1596
01:25:17.380 --> 01:25:18.250
<b>Thank you. everyone.</b>

1597
01:25:18.790 --> 01:25:19.420
<b>Well done!</b>

1598
01:25:19.500 --> 01:25:20.750
<b>Great work. Prosecutor Fok!</b>

1599
01:25:26.080 --> 01:25:27.460
<b>Hello. Mr. Fok.</b>

1600
01:25:27.960 --> 01:25:30.080
<font size="57"><b>You're taking leave today and not going back to the DOJ?</b></font>

1601
01:25:30.250 --> 01:25:31.830
<b>What's going on? Is everything alright?</b>

1602
01:25:33.330 --> 01:25:34.370
<b>Thank you.</b>

1603
01:25:38.000 --> 01:25:39.830
<b>How are things now?</b>

1604
01:25:41.210 --> 01:25:42.830
<b>How did this case</b>

1605
01:25:42.830 --> 01:25:44.250
<b>go so wrong?</b>

1606
01:25:44.290 --> 01:25:45.460
<b>Someone has been killed</b>

1607
01:25:46.080 --> 01:25:48.080
<b>How long can you continue with this?</b>

1608
01:25:48.380 --> 01:25:49.870
<font size="57"><b>Uncle Ma has been killed.</b></font>

1609
01:25:51.290 --> 01:25:52.420
<b>Are you completely blind to everything?</b>

1610
01:25:52.750 --> 01:25:54.460
<b>Uncle Ma's death is a police case.</b>

1611
01:25:54.790 --> 01:25:56.210
<b>a criminal case.</b>

1612
01:25:56.330 --> 01:25:57.870
<b>We are the Department of Justice.</b>

1613
01:26:00.580 --> 01:26:02.830
<b>Have you ever thought about going back to being a police officer?</b>

1614
01:26:02.830 --> 01:26:04.920
<b>Then you can investigate murder cases and catch criminals.</b>

1615
01:26:05.380 --> 01:26:07.170
<font size="57"><b>You can even become a defense lawyer.</b></font>

1616
01:26:07.170 --> 01:26:08.920
<b>You enjoy being a defense lawyer so much.</b>

1617
01:26:09.210 --> 01:26:11.420
<b>you're wasting your talents at the Department of Justice.</b>

1618
01:26:11.420 --> 01:26:12.580
<b>Do you know what the Department of Justice is for?</b>

1619
01:26:12.580 --> 01:26:14.330
<b>Let me tell you.</b>

1620
01:26:14.330 --> 01:26:16.580
<b>The Department of Justice is the final gate of the rule of law.</b>

1621
01:26:16.580 --> 01:26:17.540
<b>Now. Uncle Ma</b>

1622
01:26:18.880 --> 01:26:19.960
<font size="57"><b>has been murdered.</b></font>

1623
01:26:20.250 --> 01:26:21.500
<b>and Ma Ka-kit is going to be imprisoned for 27 years.</b>

1624
01:26:21.500 --> 01:26:23.710
<b>Even if he's guilty. should he be imprisoned for 27 years?</b>

1625
01:26:23.710 --> 01:26:24.710
<b>You tell me.</b>

1626
01:26:27.250 --> 01:26:28.210
<b>Honestly.</b>

1627
01:26:28.210 --> 01:26:29.920
<b>27 years is a bit excessive.</b>

1628
01:26:30.460 --> 01:26:31.500
<b>We are the Department of Justice.</b>

1629
01:26:31.500 --> 01:26:34.580
<font size="57"><b>Do you know how many pending cases we have in our department?</b></font>

1630
01:26:34.580 --> 01:26:37.420
<b>If every colleague handled their work the way you do.</b>

1631
01:26:37.420 --> 01:26:39.330
<b>the DOJ would be paralyzed. do you understand?</b>

1632
01:26:39.380 --> 01:26:41.170
<b>Given your current stale of mind.</b>

1633
01:26:41.420 --> 01:26:43.870
<b>you are not suitable to continue as the lead prosecutor on this case.</b>

1634
01:26:43.880 --> 01:26:46.330
<font size="57"><b>and it's even more unsuitable for you to remain in the DOJ.</b></font>

1635
01:26:46.420 --> 01:26:47.920
<b>I have already submitted a letter to the Civil Service Bureau</b>

1636
01:26:47.920 --> 01:26:49.870
<b>requesting your transfer.</b>

1637
01:26:49.880 --> 01:26:52.080
<b>You will receive notice in one month. OK?</b>

1638
01:26:52.420 --> 01:26:53.290
<b>Are you serious?</b>

1639
01:26:53.460 --> 01:26:53.870
<b>Yeah.</b>

1640
01:26:53.880 --> 01:26:54.500
<b>Get out!</b>

1641
01:26:54.790 --> 01:26:55.540
<b>Thank you!</b>

1642
01:26:59.290 --> 01:27:01.500
<font size="57"><b>You're useless!</b></font>

1643
01:27:02.250 --> 01:27:03.460
<b>Stop putting on airs!</b>

1644
01:27:03.500 --> 01:27:04.870
<b>All those books you've read are useless.</b>

1645
01:27:05.000 --> 01:27:05.580
<b>What?</b>

1646
01:27:05.670 --> 01:27:06.870
<b>Dressing in a suit and acting like a gentleman.</b>

1647
01:27:06.880 --> 01:27:07.750
<b>you're one of those people</b>

1648
01:27:07.750 --> 01:27:10.330
<b>who wouldn't help an old lady cross the street.</b>

1649
01:27:10.330 --> 01:27:12.170
<b>You have no friends. you're selfish.</b>

1650
01:27:12.290 --> 01:27:13.330
<font size="57"><b>only thinking of yourself.</b></font>

1651
01:27:13.330 --> 01:27:15.080
<b>You don't even own a pet!</b>

1652
01:27:15.080 --> 01:27:16.670
<b>Go home and jerk off!</b>

1653
01:27:16.790 --> 01:27:18.210
<b>Oh. and don't leave just yet.</b>

1654
01:27:23.080 --> 01:27:25.250
<b>I have evidence of your collaborating with Au.</b>

1655
01:27:25.580 --> 01:27:27.210
<b>How much longer do you plan to slander me?</b>

1656
01:27:27.750 --> 01:27:28.830
<b>What are you up to now?</b>

1657
01:27:28.880 --> 01:27:29.960
<b>Taking off your jacket?</b>

1658
01:27:30.000 --> 01:27:30.670
<font size="57"><b>You want to fight?</b></font>

1659
01:27:30.670 --> 01:27:31.710
<b>I've put up with you for a long time!</b>

1660
01:27:31.750 --> 01:27:33.460
<b>Let's see if you have the guts. You talk about Au Pak-man all the time!</b>

1661
01:27:33.460 --> 01:27:35.170
<b>You get hundreds of thousands from the government every month!</b>

1662
01:27:35.210 --> 01:27:37.120
<b>I'm telling you. I'm giving you one chance.</b>

1663
01:27:37.130 --> 01:27:38.420
<b>Yeung Ti-lap? If you beat me.</b>

1664
01:27:38.420 --> 01:27:40.000
<font size="57"><b>Let's see how strong you are! I'll let you off!</b></font>

1665
01:27:40.000 --> 01:27:41.210
<b>I'm tough like iron. Let's fight.</b>

1666
01:27:41.210 --> 01:27:41.920
<b>Let's go!</b>

1667
01:27:42.420 --> 01:27:44.670
<b>Fight with me? Many people like Au Pak-man in this world.</b>

1668
01:27:44.670 --> 01:27:45.710
<b>Can you arrest them all?</b>

1669
01:27:45.710 --> 01:27:46.250
<b>Come on!</b>

1670
01:27:46.290 --> 01:27:46.830
<b>I'm in.</b>

1671
01:27:47.540 --> 01:27:48.500
<b>Come on.</b>

1672
01:27:50.750 --> 01:27:51.290
<b>Let's go!</b>

1673
01:27:58.040 --> 01:28:00.370
<font size="57"><b>Beat me and I'll back you up!</b></font>

1674
01:28:03.710 --> 01:28:05.250
<b>Get ready to back me up. then!</b>

1675
01:28:05.420 --> 01:28:06.620
<b>You wish!</b>

1676
01:28:15.880 --> 01:28:17.080
<b>Playing tricks on me with blank paper?</b>

1677
01:28:17.330 --> 01:28:19.040
<b>How else would I make you show some real fire?</b>

1678
01:28:20.330 --> 01:28:21.250
<b>I did what I had to do!</b>

1679
01:28:21.630 --> 01:28:22.710
<b>You really have a way.</b>

1680
01:28:34.000 --> 01:28:35.830
<b>Brother Tung. the US dollars you asked for.</b>

1681
01:28:36.290 --> 01:28:37.290
<font size="57"><b>Count it yourself.</b></font>

1682
01:28:38.580 --> 01:28:41.120
<b>Nakamura. put that over there.</b>

1683
01:28:41.290 --> 01:28:41.750
<b>Yes. sir.</b>

1684
01:28:45.000 --> 01:28:48.960
<b>Gentlemen. every dollar has been laundered.</b>

1685
01:28:49.290 --> 01:28:51.040
<b>Look for me when you need something else done.</b>

1686
01:28:54.290 --> 01:28:55.330
<b>What a guy!</b>

1687
01:28:59.330 --> 01:29:01.370
<b>Man's delivery accomplished! Everybody happy!</b>

1688
01:29:01.380 --> 01:29:02.920
<b>Man's delivery accomplished! Everybody happy!</b>

1689
01:29:03.080 --> 01:29:06.330
<font size="57"><b>But I still have something to ask Lau Siu-keung.</b></font>

1690
01:29:06.330 --> 01:29:06.920
<b>Hey.</b>

1691
01:29:07.080 --> 01:29:07.920
<b>Yes. Tung?</b>

1692
01:29:07.920 --> 01:29:08.250
<b>Yes. Tung?</b>

1693
01:29:08.250 --> 01:29:10.580
<b>The police are searching everywherefor information on you.</b>

1694
01:29:10.750 --> 01:29:12.080
<b>You will definitely involve Man.</b>

1695
01:29:12.210 --> 01:29:13.670
<b>You’ll bring trouble to us.</b>

1696
01:29:13.790 --> 01:29:14.710
<b>It's my fault.</b>

1697
01:29:15.130 --> 01:29:15.790
<font size="57"><b>I'll settle the matter.</b></font>

1698
01:29:15.830 --> 01:29:18.120
<b>Why are we talking about these things?</b>

1699
01:29:18.670 --> 01:29:19.750
<b>We're all so happy now.</b>

1700
01:29:19.920 --> 01:29:21.120
<b>Let's just drink.</b>

1701
01:29:22.000 --> 01:29:23.710
<b>I've sorted it out with Keung already.</b>

1702
01:29:23.750 --> 01:29:26.710
<b>He will turn himself in and plead guilty.</b>

1703
01:29:26.710 --> 01:29:29.210
<b>When the whole matter will be resolved cleanly.</b>

1704
01:29:29.250 --> 01:29:31.000
<font size="57"><b>In any case. it won't bother you.</b></font>

1705
01:29:31.380 --> 01:29:32.080
<b>Come on.</b>

1706
01:29:32.130 --> 01:29:33.040
<b>Let's drink!</b>

1707
01:29:36.920 --> 01:29:37.830
<b>Thank you. Sang.</b>

1708
01:29:38.920 --> 01:29:39.790
<b>Gentlemen.</b>

1709
01:29:39.960 --> 01:29:41.210
<b>Keung is very capable.</b>

1710
01:29:41.580 --> 01:29:44.330
<b>If there's any offense. please forgive him.</b>

1711
01:29:44.330 --> 01:29:46.920
<b>Show me some respect. Don't blame him.</b>

1712
01:29:47.540 --> 01:29:48.500
<b>Today</b>

1713
01:29:48.880 --> 01:29:50.210
<font size="57"><b>is Sang's birthday.</b></font>

1714
01:29:51.130 --> 01:29:53.250
<b>I prepared a small birthday present for you.</b>

1715
01:29:55.790 --> 01:29:57.000
<b>Take a look! Do you like it?</b>

1716
01:30:05.500 --> 01:30:06.290
<b>Man.</b>

1717
01:30:07.630 --> 01:30:08.500
<b>you're a smart guy!</b>

1718
01:30:08.500 --> 01:30:11.290
<b>Sang. I wish you success that shines just as brightly.</b>

1719
01:30:11.290 --> 01:30:13.500
<b>Like fireworks. the more you shoot. the more dazzling!</b>

1720
01:30:14.170 --> 01:30:14.830
<b>Times up!</b>

1721
01:30:22.960 --> 01:30:24.330
<font size="57"><b>Have you gone crazy?</b></font>

1722
01:30:25.000 --> 01:30:26.330
<b>Today is my birthday.</b>

1723
01:30:26.960 --> 01:30:28.000
<b>We agreed that I would do the shooting!</b>

1724
01:30:28.000 --> 01:30:29.750
<b>It’s only just your birthday. birthday boy!</b>

1725
01:30:29.750 --> 01:30:32.080
<b>Wb agreed to shoot at 12:30.</b>

1726
01:30:32.080 --> 01:30:33.580
<b>You didn't do it. so I went ahead!</b>

1727
01:30:33.580 --> 01:30:35.210
<b>It's my turn this time. If you wanted to shoot.</b>

1728
01:30:35.210 --> 01:30:37.250
<font size="57"><b>you should have done it at the stern of the ship.</b></font>

1729
01:30:37.250 --> 01:30:39.540
<b>You shot him here. Now look at this mess!</b>

1730
01:30:39.670 --> 01:30:43.080
<b>I need to change the furniture. It takes time to order it from Italy.</b>

1731
01:30:43.080 --> 01:30:43.920
<b>I couldn't wait!</b>

1732
01:30:43.920 --> 01:30:45.870
<b>What if he drinks all my booze?</b>

1733
01:30:47.040 --> 01:30:47.670
<b>Let's drink!</b>

1734
01:30:49.330 --> 01:30:50.500
<b>Happy Birthday.</b>

1735
01:30:59.580 --> 01:31:01.540
<font size="57"><b>The dead body floating in the sea has been confirmed as Lau Siu-keung.</b></font>

1736
01:31:01.540 --> 01:31:03.500
<b>Even with the testimony of the girl from the laundry shop.</b>

1737
01:31:03.540 --> 01:31:05.040
<b>we don't have enough evidence to charge him.</b>

1738
01:31:05.080 --> 01:31:06.580
<b>Their next target will definitely be Chan Kwok-wing.</b>

1739
01:31:06.790 --> 01:31:09.000
<b>We don't know if he's in hiding or has already been killed.</b>

1740
01:31:09.080 --> 01:31:10.080
<b>We just can't find him.</b>

1741
01:31:10.290 --> 01:31:11.460
<font size="57"><b>The trial is about to begina.</b></font>

1742
01:31:11.580 --> 01:31:13.420
<b>we need to find Chan Kwok-wing as soon as possible.</b>

1743
01:31:56.080 --> 01:31:58.460
<b>As long as you tell the whole truth.</b>

1744
01:31:58.540 --> 01:32:00.120
<b>I will definitely help you reduce your sentence.</b>

1745
01:32:00.670 --> 01:32:02.370
<b>and if your testimony can help</b>

1746
01:32:02.670 --> 01:32:04.830
<b>incriminate the whole gang of drug traffickers.</b>

1747
01:32:05.290 --> 01:32:08.040
<font size="57"><b>I will also consider helping you apply for amnesty.</b></font>

1748
01:32:08.170 --> 01:32:10.920
<b>If you become our witness. you will definitely benefit.</b>

1749
01:32:11.210 --> 01:32:13.290
<b>The amount of the sentence reduction depends on how much you say.</b>

1750
01:32:16.540 --> 01:32:18.250
<b>My brother left evidence for me.</b>

1751
01:32:18.500 --> 01:32:20.370
<b>which can prove that Au Pak-man is the culprit.</b>

1752
01:32:20.790 --> 01:32:22.170
<b>I even know where his drug den is.</b>

1753
01:32:22.500 --> 01:32:23.620
<font size="57"><b>Make sure I get a reduced sentence</b></font>

1754
01:32:24.380 --> 01:32:25.920
<b>Do you have any other options?</b>

1755
01:32:49.460 --> 01:32:50.250
<b>Prosecutor Yeung.</b>

1756
01:32:51.170 --> 01:32:52.290
<b>Fok Chi-ho hasn't arrived yet.</b>

1757
01:32:52.420 --> 01:32:54.210
<b>Just do what I say later.</b>

1758
01:33:14.750 --> 01:33:15.580
<b>My leg...</b>

1759
01:33:16.580 --> 01:33:17.580
<b>I can't walk.</b>

1760
01:33:19.500 --> 01:33:20.290
<b>Sit down.</b>

1761
01:33:21.710 --> 01:33:23.580
<b>You can't walk? Take him with you and get going!</b>

1762
01:33:23.790 --> 01:33:24.790
<font size="57"><b>Court is in session. Get going</b></font>

1763
01:33:25.670 --> 01:33:26.040
<b>Go!</b>

1764
01:33:26.420 --> 01:33:27.540
<b>Look out for me. Officer!</b>

1765
01:33:28.210 --> 01:33:28.790
<b>Take care.</b>

1766
01:33:30.250 --> 01:33:31.290
<b>Someone wants to kill me!</b>

1767
01:33:31.920 --> 01:33:33.040
<b>Don't let me die!</b>

1768
01:33:36.830 --> 01:33:38.210
<b>I'm Inspector Lee King-wai.</b>

1769
01:33:38.710 --> 01:33:40.620
<b>I'm at the intersection of Ki Lung Street...</b>

1770
01:33:50.960 --> 01:33:52.620
<b>They want to kill me!</b>

1771
01:33:52.960 --> 01:33:54.460
<font size="57"><b>I'm in danger!</b></font>

1772
01:33:55.380 --> 01:33:58.040
<b>Hurry and take me with you! Lef's go already!</b>

1773
01:33:58.630 --> 01:34:00.540
<b>Defendant Ma Ka-kit's appeal</b>

1774
01:34:00.540 --> 01:34:03.120
<b>in the drug trafficking conspiracy case was successful.</b>

1775
01:34:03.130 --> 01:34:05.170
<b>The case will be retried today.</b>

1776
01:34:05.330 --> 01:34:06.710
<b>Miss Cheung Yeuk-sum.</b>

1777
01:34:06.710 --> 01:34:10.080
<b>a few years ago. you received a package at your home.</b>

1778
01:34:10.630 --> 01:34:13.330
<font size="57"><b>Inside. there were 500 grams of cocaine</b></font>

1779
01:34:13.630 --> 01:34:16.710
<b>and at that time. you admitted to the crime of drug trafficking.</b>

1780
01:34:16.880 --> 01:34:18.120
<b>Is that true?</b>

1781
01:34:18.210 --> 01:34:19.620
<b>Actually. it was Chan Kwok-wing.</b>

1782
01:34:19.630 --> 01:34:21.670
<b>gave me a thousand bucks to use my home address.</b>

1783
01:34:21.670 --> 01:34:24.120
<b>I didn't know there were drugs in that package.</b>

1784
01:34:24.250 --> 01:34:26.500
<b>My former boss. Lau Siu-keung.</b>

1785
01:34:26.830 --> 01:34:28.370
<font size="57"><b>introduced me to Au Pak-man.</b></font>

1786
01:34:28.380 --> 01:34:31.250
<b>They were the ones who told me to plead guilty.</b>

1787
01:34:31.250 --> 01:34:32.040
<b>Do you have any evidence?</b>

1788
01:34:32.040 --> 01:34:34.120
<b>I've already been jailed for this! Is that not evidence?</b>

1789
01:34:34.130 --> 01:34:38.460
<b>The key figures in our case. Chan Kwok-wing and Lau Siu-keung.</b>

1790
01:34:38.460 --> 01:34:40.170
<b>are not present in the courtroom.</b>

1791
01:34:41.040 --> 01:34:43.330
<font size="57"><b>So I would like to summon the next witness.</b></font>

1792
01:34:43.330 --> 01:34:45.000
<b>Mr. Au Pak-man. to testify</b>

1793
01:34:45.630 --> 01:34:49.460
<b>and help reconstruct the sequence of events.</b>

1794
01:34:52.500 --> 01:34:54.830
<b>This case was actually easy for me to handle within the law</b>

1795
01:34:54.830 --> 01:34:56.250
<b>but you bastards insisted on killing someone</b>

1796
01:34:56.250 --> 01:34:57.670
<b>and you killed the big brother and his little brother as well.</b>

1797
01:34:57.670 --> 01:35:00.750
<font size="57"><b>If Chan Kwok-wing has any evidence in his hands. I'm screwed!</b></font>

1798
01:35:00.830 --> 01:35:04.250
<b>If you run away. this case will never be closed.</b>

1799
01:35:04.380 --> 01:35:06.210
<b>Sooner or later. the police will find out more and more.</b>

1800
01:35:06.330 --> 01:35:07.790
<b>We will all end up dead.</b>

1801
01:35:08.000 --> 01:35:11.120
<b>Settle it in court tomorrow. and we'll all be happy.</b>

1802
01:35:11.130 --> 01:35:12.460
<b>Are you out of your mind?</b>

1803
01:35:12.750 --> 01:35:14.250
<font size="57"><b>You're forcing me to appear in court.</b></font>

1804
01:35:14.830 --> 01:35:16.120
<b>Are you playing with me?</b>

1805
01:35:16.500 --> 01:35:17.920
<b>Let me tell you. if I die.</b>

1806
01:35:17.920 --> 01:35:19.210
<b>I will definitely take you down with me.</b>

1807
01:35:19.210 --> 01:35:20.370
<b>Think a little with what brains you have.</b>

1808
01:35:20.380 --> 01:35:22.120
<b>How much money have you made over the years thanks to me?</b>

1809
01:35:22.250 --> 01:35:23.670
<b>Without me. you're nothing but shit!</b>

1810
01:35:23.670 --> 01:35:26.210
<font size="57"><b>It's only a matter of time before I'll really eat shit.</b></font>

1811
01:35:27.380 --> 01:35:29.080
<b>You need to stay calm now.</b>

1812
01:35:29.080 --> 01:35:30.960
<b>Let's fix this together.</b>

1813
01:35:31.210 --> 01:35:32.500
<b>Kve made some arrangements.</b>

1814
01:35:33.040 --> 01:35:34.250
<b>Do you know</b>

1815
01:35:34.540 --> 01:35:38.540
<b>which place on this planet sees the sunrise first?</b>

1816
01:35:40.580 --> 01:35:42.370
<b>It's Fiji.</b>

1817
01:35:43.040 --> 01:35:45.330
<b>I've already bought a small island there.</b>

1818
01:35:45.500 --> 01:35:47.620
<font size="57"><b>I'm ready to go and enjoy life.</b></font>

1819
01:35:47.830 --> 01:35:48.920
<b>In Hong Kong.</b>

1820
01:35:49.790 --> 01:35:51.420
<b>there are skyscrapers everywhere.</b>

1821
01:35:51.960 --> 01:35:54.710
<b>It's hard to see the sunrise anymore.</b>

1822
01:35:57.920 --> 01:35:59.460
<b>What about Chan Kwok-wing?</b>

1823
01:35:59.460 --> 01:36:01.540
<b>His testimony also indicated</b>

1824
01:36:01.630 --> 01:36:04.620
<b>that he and his brother Lau Siu-keung were both working for you.</b>

1825
01:36:05.130 --> 01:36:07.170
<font size="57"><b>He is primarily responsible for finding people.</b></font>

1826
01:36:07.170 --> 01:36:09.500
<b>borrowing addresses and receiving packages.</b>

1827
01:36:10.170 --> 01:36:12.460
<b>while his brother was responsible for introducing lawyers to the victims.</b>

1828
01:36:12.460 --> 01:36:14.710
<b>including Miss Cheung Yeuk-sum</b>

1829
01:36:14.710 --> 01:36:16.540
<b>and Mr. Ma Ka-kit.</b>

1830
01:36:16.540 --> 01:36:18.790
<b>Do you have any explanation for these accusations?</b>

1831
01:36:19.420 --> 01:36:20.790
<b>Listen to me.</b>

1832
01:36:20.880 --> 01:36:23.870
<font size="57"><b>Go to court tomorrow and resolve the matter.</b></font>

1833
01:36:24.630 --> 01:36:25.960
<b>I'll take you with me.</b>

1834
01:36:26.330 --> 01:36:27.460
<b>Once we're there.</b>

1835
01:36:29.000 --> 01:36:31.580
<b>you'll be able to see the sunrise every day.</b>

1836
01:36:32.540 --> 01:36:34.210
<b>I'll take care of things</b>

1837
01:36:34.540 --> 01:36:35.960
<b>outside of the courtroom.</b>

1838
01:36:38.130 --> 01:36:39.000
<b>First of all.</b>

1839
01:36:40.000 --> 01:36:42.670
<b>I don't know what statements he gave to the police.</b>

1840
01:36:42.880 --> 01:36:44.420
<font size="57"><b>but one thing I do know is that</b></font>

1841
01:36:44.420 --> 01:36:46.620
<b>he won't be able to testify in court if he can't show up.</b>

1842
01:36:46.630 --> 01:36:48.620
<b>and there will be no evidence for what you're worried about.</b>

1843
01:36:49.580 --> 01:36:50.460
<b>Prosecutor Yeung.</b>

1844
01:36:50.580 --> 01:36:53.210
<b>don't think I don't know what you're up to.</b>

1845
01:36:53.210 --> 01:36:57.000
<b>You're using my courtroom to try and expose the crimes of others.</b>

1846
01:36:57.080 --> 01:37:00.170
<font size="57"><b>What exactly do you want to achieve by doing this?</b></font>

1847
01:37:00.460 --> 01:37:02.120
<b>To answer your question. Your Honour:</b>

1848
01:37:02.130 --> 01:37:03.370
<b>I want to request</b>

1849
01:37:03.380 --> 01:37:06.960
<b>that Chan Kwok-wing appear in court as a special witness for the prosecution.</b>

1850
01:37:07.040 --> 01:37:08.540
<b>He hasn't made the request.</b>

1851
01:37:09.750 --> 01:37:12.290
<b>If there's no request. I won't approve it.</b>

1852
01:37:12.290 --> 01:37:13.670
<b>This is unfair to the defense.</b>

1853
01:37:13.670 --> 01:37:14.540
<font size="57"><b>Your Honor.</b></font>

1854
01:37:14.880 --> 01:37:16.370
<b>I don't oppose it at all.</b>

1855
01:37:19.540 --> 01:37:20.830
<b>Are you two playing tricks on me together?</b>

1856
01:37:20.960 --> 01:37:22.000
<b>Your Honor.</b>

1857
01:37:22.000 --> 01:37:25.290
<b>I humbly request your approval for Chan Kwok-wing to testify in court.</b>

1858
01:37:25.580 --> 01:37:27.750
<b>If you're not satisfied after hearing his testimony.</b>

1859
01:37:27.750 --> 01:37:30.330
<b>I'm willing to bear all the consequences and responsibilities.</b>

1860
01:37:30.330 --> 01:37:33.040
<font size="57"><b>When will your witness appear. then?</b></font>

1861
01:41:16.920 --> 01:41:18.670
<b>Mr. Fok!</b>

1862
01:42:33.000 --> 01:42:34.420
<b>Prosecutor Fok.</b>

1863
01:42:36.540 --> 01:42:38.170
<b>Sang and I spent ten years in jail</b>

1864
01:42:39.330 --> 01:42:42.290
<b>in Cambodia because of you.</b>

1865
01:42:42.920 --> 01:42:44.580
<b>You've arrested so many people.</b>

1866
01:42:44.830 --> 01:42:46.210
<b>Don't you recognize me?</b>

1867
01:42:55.460 --> 01:42:57.080
<b>That stubborn old man. Uncle Ma.</b>

1868
01:42:57.080 --> 01:42:58.710
<font size="57"><b>I cut him over a dozen times.</b></font>

1869
01:42:58.830 --> 01:43:00.290
<b>and his guts spilled all over the floor.</b>

1870
01:43:01.130 --> 01:43:02.170
<b>I enjoyed it!</b>

1871
01:43:02.170 --> 01:43:03.080
<b>It's your turn now.</b>

1872
01:44:48.630 --> 01:44:52.000
<b>This is how the law works. Prosecutor Fok.</b>

1873
01:44:53.130 --> 01:44:53.790
<b>Hey!</b>

1874
01:44:56.290 --> 01:44:57.120
<b>I object.</b>

1875
01:45:52.790 --> 01:45:53.870
<b>Would you like to appeal?</b>

1876
01:45:54.380 --> 01:45:56.330
<font size="57"><b>The courtroom is a place to uncover the truth.</b></font>

1877
01:45:56.540 --> 01:45:59.370
<b>Time means nothing in the face of the truth.</b>

1878
01:45:59.380 --> 01:46:01.420
<b>So no matter how much time it takes.</b>

1879
01:46:01.540 --> 01:46:03.670
<b>we must wait for the truth to come out.</b>

1880
01:46:03.670 --> 01:46:04.580
<b>Isn't that right?</b>

1881
01:46:05.040 --> 01:46:05.830
<b>Prosecutor Yeung.</b>

1882
01:46:05.960 --> 01:46:07.750
<b>could you please stop reciting poetry here?</b>

1883
01:46:08.000 --> 01:46:10.040
<font size="57"><b>When can he come?</b></font>

1884
01:46:23.830 --> 01:46:24.540
<b>I'm here!</b>

1885
01:46:30.000 --> 01:46:31.750
<b>Sorry. Your Honor.</b>

1886
01:46:32.630 --> 01:46:33.790
<b>there was some heavy traffic.</b>

1887
01:46:38.000 --> 01:46:39.620
<b>My brother left evidence for me.</b>

1888
01:46:40.130 --> 01:46:43.120
<b>including account books and records of drug transactions.</b>

1889
01:46:43.710 --> 01:46:45.580
<b>and all of Au Pak-man's bank accounts.</b>

1890
01:46:45.790 --> 01:46:47.920
<font size="57"><b>He said to use them as insurance if something happened.</b></font>

1891
01:46:48.880 --> 01:46:51.830
<b>Ma Ka-kit had no idea the package contained drugs.</b>

1892
01:46:51.960 --> 01:46:53.670
<b>Au Pak-man even told me to plead guilty.</b>

1893
01:46:54.000 --> 01:46:55.960
<b>He said if I didn't. he would kill me.</b>

1894
01:46:56.170 --> 01:46:57.620
<b>Do you think I'm so afraid of you?</b>

1895
01:46:57.880 --> 01:46:59.710
<b>Even if I have to go to prison. I'll expose you</b>

1896
01:46:59.710 --> 01:47:01.330
<font size="57"><b>Au Pak-man. you bastard!</b></font>

1897
01:47:08.420 --> 01:47:11.790
<b>Prosecutor. do you have any final words?</b>

1898
01:47:26.080 --> 01:47:27.210
<b>Ladies and gentlemen.</b>

1899
01:47:31.460 --> 01:47:32.540
<b>in Hong Kong.</b>

1900
01:47:33.630 --> 01:47:35.330
<b>the court values evidence above all.</b>

1901
01:47:37.420 --> 01:47:39.080
<b>but evidence does not always equal the truth.</b>

1902
01:47:39.750 --> 01:47:42.830
<b>nor does it necessarily guarantee us justice.</b>

1903
01:47:46.380 --> 01:47:48.420
<b>Furthermore.</b>

1904
01:47:48.630 --> 01:47:52.000
<font size="57"><b>no judicial system is perfect.</b></font>

1905
01:47:52.290 --> 01:47:56.170
<b>and loopholes can arise.</b>

1906
01:47:56.790 --> 01:47:58.330
<b>These loopholes</b>

1907
01:47:59.080 --> 01:48:01.000
<b>are often exploited</b>

1908
01:48:01.460 --> 01:48:04.870
<b>by individuals with malicious intent.</b>

1909
01:48:05.000 --> 01:48:07.830
<b>When we let innocent people fall victim to these loopholes.</b>

1910
01:48:08.130 --> 01:48:10.250
<b>as in the case of Ma Ka-kit this time.</b>

1911
01:48:10.920 --> 01:48:12.370
<b>just one wrongful judgement</b>

1912
01:48:13.790 --> 01:48:16.370
<font size="57"><b>can destroy an entire family.</b></font>

1913
01:48:17.040 --> 01:48:18.870
<b>That is why we do not allow wrongful judgments</b>

1914
01:48:20.540 --> 01:48:24.120
<b>to happen under our watch.</b>

1915
01:48:27.420 --> 01:48:30.330
<b>to Ma Ka-kit.</b>

1916
01:48:34.130 --> 01:48:34.460
<b>or</b>

1917
01:48:36.080 --> 01:48:38.170
<b>to anyone!</b>

1918
01:48:41.630 --> 01:48:44.870
<b>This is our conscience as legal personnel. Your Honor!</b>

1919
01:48:53.580 --> 01:48:56.750
<b>This court hereby pronounces the verdict:</b>

1920
01:48:56.750 --> 01:48:59.710
<font size="57"><b>The first defendant. Ma Ka-kit. is found not guilty of drug trafficking charges</b></font>

1921
01:48:59.710 --> 01:49:01.790
<b>and is to be released.</b>

1922
01:49:19.290 --> 01:49:22.870
<b>The DOJ celebrates the fact that</b>

1923
01:49:22.880 --> 01:49:24.580
<b>the Ma Ka-kit case has been successfully appealed.</b>

1924
01:49:24.580 --> 01:49:27.830
<b>The DOJ will continue to optimise its own performance.</b>

1925
01:49:27.830 --> 01:49:29.670
<b>enhancing the efficiency. quality. and consistency</b>

1926
01:49:29.670 --> 01:49:31.500
<font size="57"><b>of prosecutorial decisions.</b></font>

1927
01:49:31.580 --> 01:49:34.870
<b>It will also strengthen cooperation with other government departments</b>

1928
01:49:34.920 --> 01:49:38.170
<b>to provide high-quality legal services to Hong Kong society.</b>

1929
01:49:38.330 --> 01:49:41.870
<b>ensuring fairness and justice in the judicial process.</b>

1930
01:50:25.880 --> 01:50:28.370
<b>Judge Hui. by overturning your own verdict in the Ma Ka-chun case.</b>

1931
01:50:28.420 --> 01:50:30.330
<font size="57"><b>does it mean that the judicial system is not fair enough?</b></font>

1932
01:50:30.330 --> 01:50:31.960
<b>Does it imply that someone made mistakes?</b>

1933
01:50:33.170 --> 01:50:34.210
<b>That's right.</b>

1934
01:50:35.080 --> 01:50:36.330
<b>I admit it.</b>

1935
01:50:36.330 --> 01:50:38.290
<b>The initial judgment</b>

1936
01:50:38.500 --> 01:50:39.580
<b>in this case</b>

1937
01:50:40.080 --> 01:50:41.210
<b>was indeed flawed.</b>

1938
01:50:41.710 --> 01:50:45.620
<b>This has raised doubts and concerns among the public.</b>

1939
01:50:45.880 --> 01:50:47.040
<font size="57"><b>Regarding this matter.</b></font>

1940
01:50:47.130 --> 01:50:49.670
<b>I sincerely</b>

1941
01:50:49.830 --> 01:50:52.370
<b>feel regret and l apologise.</b>

1942
01:50:55.000 --> 01:50:58.920
<b>Qualified Youth Program tuition assistance application notice</b>

1943
01:51:03.000 --> 01:51:07.540
<b>Nothing can dim the light which shines from within. Fok Chi-ho</b>

1944
01:51:07.540 --> 01:51:10.830
<b>Now. in this case. the truth has finally emerged.</b>

1945
01:51:10.920 --> 01:51:12.120
<b>and the facts have become clear.</b>

1946
01:51:12.250 --> 01:51:15.210
<font size="57"><b>The most important thing is that justice is done.</b></font>

1947
01:51:15.380 --> 01:51:16.830
<b>That's the most important.</b>

1948
01:51:59.670 --> 01:52:00.540
<b>Court!</b>

1949
